39	page	Athletics	运动	Athletics	运动	life/athletics	{"root":{"props":{"title":"Athletics"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-d939e372-11ea-4441-85da-a2e888d8dce6"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"We are B-A-I-D!","text":"Sport is part of who we are at BAID. On the field, we face challenges, share goals, and keep improving—together.","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-5e2c22b8-d137-4e32-903b-3c9249a7f8a5"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-e15de9f2-9a0f-4943-bbc0-8dc2b2cf4591"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Athletics","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"topPadding":false,"id":"HeroConfig-e0fc8da8-6d32-4410-8993-20609611fd71","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-cf6ffe6e-f823-40b8-a2fe-c38a6ea5c5e4"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Let's go B-A-I-D!","text":"Just like in the classroom, we push ourselves to do better. In games, we win and we lose. Both matter. They teach us to face pressure, handle success, and keep going when things don't go our way.\\n","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-ca59c099-12bf-4f7a-b884-66758dd8dbed"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-076f45b1-e536-4962-b178-a1ec4a650d7b"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-efb82f5c-453f-4b18-89c1-c2df97d176e1","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"Outstanding Facilities","text":"We train and compete across three athletic fields, an international-standard pool, a full gym, plus basketball and tennis courts. There's space for all of us to get moving.","image":{"id":64,"sha1":"15f6901d80775583c340abba2d020f0ce28fbeb6","name":"Life at BAID","altText":"People playing football on the playground","width":3976,"height":2652,"sizeKB":431,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:05:12.808Z"}},{"title":"Wide Selection","text":"At BAID, choose from more than ten options—tennis, soccer, basketball, volleyball, baseball, badminton, dance, gym, aerobics, roller skating, archery, and more. There's always something that fits.","image":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"}},{"title":"Professional Coaching","text":"Experienced coaches guide students throughout their training, from fundamentals to advanced skills, while also supporting individual growth and performance. Events such as the BA Cup keep the energy high across campus.","image":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"image":"64","title":"Outstanding Facilities","text":"We train and compete across three athletic fields, an international-standard pool, a full gym, plus basketball and tennis courts. There's space for all of us to get moving."},{"title":"Wide Selection","image":"67","text":"At BAID, choose from more than ten options—tennis, soccer, basketball, volleyball, baseball, badminton, dance, gym, aerobics, roller skating, archery, and more. There's always something that fits."},{"title":"Professional Coaching","image":"66","text":"Experienced coaches guide students throughout their training, from fundamentals to advanced skills, while also supporting individual growth and performance. Events such as the BA Cup keep the energy high across campus."}]}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-e08d1212-02d2-4580-8f48-9983eaa12d9c"}},{"type":"ImageGalleryConfig","props":{"title":"Image Slideshow","slides":[{"title":"Title","content":"Content","image":"11"}],"id":"ImageGalleryConfig-f9b94eb0-807f-4c0c-aff7-f82cb4f66151","resolvedSlides":[{"title":"Title","content":"Content","image":{"id":11,"sha1":"c3362d9dcace9926f10970230152d0d4869e1448","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":3840,"height":2563,"sizeKB":2517,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:01:29.874Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"运动"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-d939e372-11ea-4441-85da-a2e888d8dce6"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"We are B-A-I-D!","text":"“无体育，不北中。” 运动是 BAID 校园生活的重要一部分，在竞争带来的挑战与收获中，帮助我们塑造品格，建立共同目标，也不断成为更好的自己。","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-5e2c22b8-d137-4e32-903b-3c9249a7f8a5"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-e15de9f2-9a0f-4943-bbc0-8dc2b2cf4591"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Athletics","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"topPadding":false,"id":"HeroConfig-e0fc8da8-6d32-4410-8993-20609611fd71","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-cf6ffe6e-f823-40b8-a2fe-c38a6ea5c5e4"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Let's go B-A-I-D!","text":"就像在课堂上追求卓越一样，我们在赛场上也努力成为更好的自己。我们在运动场上学到的经验 — 无论胜利还是失败 — 都让我们更从容地面对挑战、拥抱成功，也能在受挫时继续前行。","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-ca59c099-12bf-4f7a-b884-66758dd8dbed"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-076f45b1-e536-4962-b178-a1ec4a650d7b"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-efb82f5c-453f-4b18-89c1-c2df97d176e1","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"优越的运动设施","text":"三片操场、国际标准游泳馆、专业健身房、篮球馆与网球场等完善设施，为日常训练与比赛提供充足空间。","image":{"id":64,"sha1":"15f6901d80775583c340abba2d020f0ce28fbeb6","name":"Life at BAID","altText":"People playing football on the playground","width":3976,"height":2652,"sizeKB":431,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:05:12.808Z"}},{"title":"丰富的体育专项","text":"BAID 提供十余项体育专项课程: 网球、足球、篮球、排球、棒球、羽毛球、舞蹈、体能、健美操、轮滑、射箭... 每个人都能找到自己的热爱。","image":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"}},{"title":"专业的教练团队","text":"经验丰富的教练全程指导，从基础到专项稳步提升，也关注每位学生的成长与状态。「北中杯」等体育赛事持续进行，激发每位同学的运动热情。","image":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"image":"64","title":"优越的运动设施","text":"三片操场、国际标准游泳馆、专业健身房、篮球馆与网球场等完善设施，为日常训练与比赛提供充足空间。"},{"title":"丰富的体育专项","image":"67","text":"BAID 提供十余项体育专项课程: 网球、足球、篮球、排球、棒球、羽毛球、舞蹈、体能、健美操、轮滑、射箭... 每个人都能找到自己的热爱。"},{"title":"专业的教练团队","image":"66","text":"经验丰富的教练全程指导，从基础到专项稳步提升，也关注每位学生的成长与状态。「北中杯」等体育赛事持续进行，激发每位同学的运动热情。"}]}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-e08d1212-02d2-4580-8f48-9983eaa12d9c"}},{"type":"ImageGalleryConfig","props":{"title":"图片轮播","slides":[{"title":"赢下了这一球!","content":"在这里填写正文，在这里填写正文。在这里填写正文，在这里填写正文。在这里填写正文，在这里填写正文。在这里填写正文，在这里填写正文。","image":"11"}],"id":"ImageGalleryConfig-f9b94eb0-807f-4c0c-aff7-f82cb4f66151","resolvedSlides":[{"title":"赢下了这一球!","content":"在这里填写正文，在这里填写正文。在这里填写正文，在这里填写正文。在这里填写正文，在这里填写正文。在这里填写正文，在这里填写正文。","image":{"id":11,"sha1":"c3362d9dcace9926f10970230152d0d4869e1448","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":3840,"height":2563,"sizeKB":2517,"uploaderId":3406762,"cre