l program is based on the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum, building strong foundations and inquiry skills.","image":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"},"link":"/academics/middle-school","linkText":"Middle School Program"},{"title":"High School","text":"Our high school program centers on AP courses, offering rigorous courses and focused academic pathways.\\n","image":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"High School Program"},{"title":"Project-Based Learning","text":"At BAID, education is more than grades. Through our project-based learning curriculum, students develop their individual strengths beyond the classroom.\\n","image":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"},"link":"/academics/pbl","linkText":"Project-Based Learning"}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"title":"Middle School","text":"Our middle school program is based on the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum, building strong foundations and inquiry skills.","image":"67","link":"/academics/middle-school","linkText":"Middle School Program"},{"title":"High School","text":"Our high school program centers on AP courses, offering rigorous courses and focused academic pathways.\\n","image":"58","linkText":"High School Program","link":"/academics/high-school"},{"title":"Project-Based Learning","text":"At BAID, education is more than grades. Through our project-based learning curriculum, students develop their individual strengths beyond the classroom.\\n","image":"65","link":"/academics/pbl","linkText":"Project-Based Learning"}]}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-78ae2799-2648-46e5-9971-5250503341c1"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-f9c3e298-2163-4d5f-8de5-b3ad3288ad9a","resolvedImage":{"id":64,"sha1":"15f6901d80775583c340abba2d020f0ce28fbeb6","name":"Life at BAID","altText":"People playing football on the playground","width":3976,"height":2652,"sizeKB":431,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:05:12.808Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"64","topText":"Rigorous Learning. Bold Thinking.","title":"Building Academic Strength with Depth and Purpose","link":"/academics","linkText":"Discover our middle and high school programs","text":"BAID brings together China's national curriculum, AP courses, and distinctive signature programs in one dynamic academic framework. Through research opportunities developed with world-leading universities and institutions, every student has the chance to take an idea from the very beginning to a meaningful academic result."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-6d98b2f6-795d-471f-ad0f-8a245cb1c7ce","resolvedImage":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"58","topText":"Rooted in China. Ready for the World.","title":"A Global Education Bridging the Best of East and West","text":"Our campus brings together students and teachers from around the world, creating a community where different perspectives meet, spark ideas, and widen horizons. Grounded in Chinese learning and enriched by programs such as Beijing Cultural Exploration Program and the Chinese Cultural Roots Journey, students engage with culture firsthand, connect tradition with the present, and build a strong Chinese identity in today's changing world.","link":"/academics/pbl","linkText":" Learn about our global curriculum","lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"backgroundColor":"#9f0612"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-4399dfff-68b2-4c0c-98d8-f877e1d9aa77","resolvedImage":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"67","title":"Where Every Experience Becomes Part of Growth","topText":"A Campus Full of Possibility","text":"Student clubs and electives bring energy and variety to campus life, spanning competition, academics, the arts, athletics, and more. Activities such as BAID Stage and BAID Speaker give students room to perform, present, and be heard. With every step, every effort, and every experience, growth takes on new meaning.","link":"/life","linkText":"Explore campus life at BAID","backgroundColor":"#103c74"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-0626afed-bac3-47ad-b37f-711559270077","resolvedImage":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"59","topText":"Compassion into Action","title":"Let's Change the World, Together","text":"In the BAID community, students begin with real needs close to home and respond with real action. From navigation software for people with visual impairments to the Pads.Now initiative and sustainability clubs, projects grow from concern, commitment, and follow-through. ","link":"/projects","linkText":"Visit our student projects gallery"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-3e3ad3af-f992-4adb-9ea8-90c96a816239","resolvedImage":{"id":11,"sha1":"c3362d9dcace9926f10970230152d0d4869e1448","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":3840,"height":2563,"sizeKB":2517,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:01:29.874Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"11","title":"Dream Far, Start Here","topText":"Where Futures Begin","text":"Since our launch, BAID students have earned outstanding admissions results and gone on to leading universities including Harvard, Stanford, Oxford, Cambridge, McGill, the University of Hong Kong, and the University of Tokyo. From here, they step onto bigger stages, pursue bigger questions, and continue growing into who they are meant to become.","link":"/academics/college-counseling","linkText":"Learn about our approach to college counseling","backgroundColor":"#9f0612"}},{"type":"QuoteConfig","props":{"text":"We will make our campus a spiritual home, a center of learning, and a fertile ground for innovation for both students and teachers — a place where they can learn to love others, help others, and respect others.","source":"Xia Qingfeng, Principal of Beijing Academy","id":"QuoteConfig-291a5a3d-2df5-4f05-8cf1-64bc75987ff4","resolvedImage":{"id":10,"sha1":"b32b8acdc3a560f8264489a45ab7ee48d8a4a68b","name":"xqf","altText":"xqf","width":1920,"height":2880,"sizeKB":130,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:25:23.284Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"10"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"主页"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"InFocusProjectsConfig","props":{"title":"世界因我更美好","description":"在北京中学，我们优秀的学生和敬业的教师踏上发现、探索和成长的旅程，在每一步中改变世界，让世界因我们而更加美好。","link":"/projects","linkText":"了解我们的学生如何改变世界","startTopText":"千里之行，始于足下","startMainText":"世