2	post	Beijing Academy Successfully Passes CIS Re-Accreditation	北京中学顺利通过CIS再认证	Beijing Academy Successfully Passes CIS Re-Accreditation	北京中学顺利通过CIS再认证	beijing-academy-successfully-passes-cis-re-accreditation	From May 17 to 23, 2025, a seven-member evaluation team from the Council of International Schools (CIS) visited Beijing Academy to conduct a week-long on-site evaluation. This visit was a crucial part of Beijing Academy's CIS Re-Accreditation process.\n\n[IMAGE: 5]\n\nDuring the evaluation period, the CIS officials engaged in in-depth interactions with students, faculty, parents, and support staff representatives through campus tours, classroom observations, and discussion forums. They conducted a comprehensive and meticulous review and assessment across CIS's nine evaluation domains: Vision and Direction, School Leadership and Governance, Curriculum, Teaching and Assessment, Student Well-being, Staffing, Campus Facilities and Information Technology, Community and Home-School Partnerships, and Boarding.\n\n[IMAGE: 4]\n\n[IMAGE: 2]\n\n### Warm Congratulations\n\nThe evaluation team highly commended Beijing Academy's commitment to its 'family' culture, its student-centered educational philosophy, and its learning atmosphere that emphasizes innovation and exploration. They fully recognized the school's continuous achievements in promoting international education.\n\nIn August 2025, CIS officially announced that Beijing Academy had successfully passed the Re-Accreditation.\n\n[IMAGE: 3]\n\nThis achievement not only signifies that the school's educational philosophy, teaching quality, and management standards have once again received high recognition from an authoritative international organization, but it will also provide strong support for students by opening up broader international exchange platforms, assisting in overseas university applications, and connecting them with more global high-quality educational resources. Simultaneously, this will further advance and enhance Beijing Academy's modernization and internationalization efforts, empowering the school to cultivate future talents with global perspectives and competitiveness.	2025 年 5 月 17 日至 23 日，国际学校联盟（Council of International Schools，以下简称 CIS）评估团队一行 7 人莅临北京中学，开展为期一周的线下评估考察。此次来访是北京中学 CIS 再认证（Re-Accreditation）的重要环节之一。\n\n[IMAGE: 5]\n\n在考察期间，认证官通过实地走访、课堂观摩、座谈交流等形式，与学生、教师、家长及后勤团队代表深入互动，围绕 CIS 九大评估领域——愿景与方向、学校领导管理、课程设置、教学与评估、学生福祉、人员配置、校园设施及信息技术、社区与家校合作、住宿——进行了全面、细致的审查与评估。\n\n[IMAGE: 4]\n\n[IMAGE: 2]\n\n<iframe src="//player.bilibili.com/player.html?isOutside=true&aid=115342353433873&bvid=BV1B3x6ztE6Z&cid=32934658558&p=1" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe>\n\n### 热烈祝贺\n\n评估团队高度肯定了北京中学所秉承的“家”文化，以学生为中心的教育理念，以及注重创新与探索的学习氛围，充分认可学校在推动国际化教育方面取得的持续成果。\n\n2025 年 8 月，CIS 正式宣布北京中学顺利通过再认证（Re-Accreditation）。\n\n[IMAGE: 3]\n\n这一成果不仅标志着学校在办学理念、教育质量和管理水平上再次获得国际权威机构的高度认可，将为学生开拓更加广阔的国际交流平台、申请海外大学提供有力支持、链接更多全球优质教育资源。同时，这也将进一步推动并提升北京中学的现代化、国际化办学水平，助力学校培养具有全球视野和竞争力的未来人才。	From May 17 to 23, 2025, a seven-member evaluation team from the Council of International Schools (CIS) visited Beijing Academy to conduct a week-long on-site evaluation. This visit was a crucial part of Beijing Academy's CIS Re-Accreditation process.\n\n[IMAGE: 5]\n\nDuring the evaluation period, the CIS officials engaged in in-depth interactions with students, faculty, parents, and support staff representatives through campus tours, classroom observations, and discussion forums. They conducted a comprehensive and meticulous review and assessment across CIS's nine evaluation domains: Vision and Direction, School Leadership and Governance, Curriculum, Teaching and Assessment, Student Well-being, Staffing, Campus Facilities and Information Technology, Community and Home-School Partnerships, and Boarding.\n\n[IMAGE: 4]\n\n[IMAGE: 2]\n\n### Warm Congratulations\n\nThe evaluation team highly commended Beijing Academy's commitment to its 'family' culture, its student-centered educational philosophy, and its learning atmosphere that emphasizes innovation and exploration. They fully recognized the school's continuous achievements in promoting international education.\n\nIn August 2025, CIS officially announced that Beijing Academy had successfully passed the Re-Accreditation.\n\n[IMAGE: 3]\n\nThis achievement not only signifies that the school's educational philosophy, teaching quality, and management standards have once again received high recognition from an authoritative international organization, but it will also provide strong support for students by opening up broader international exchange platforms, assisting in overseas university applications, and connecting them with more global high-quality educational resources. Simultaneously, this will further advance and enhance Beijing Academy's modernization and internationalization efforts, empowering the school to cultivate future talents with global perspectives and competitiveness.	2025 年 5 月 17 日至 23 日，国际学校联盟（Council of International Schools，以下简称 CIS）评估团队一行 7 人莅临北京中学，开展为期一周的线下评估考察。此次来访是北京中学 CIS 再认证（Re-Accreditation）的重要环节之一。\n\n[IMAGE: 5]\n\n在考察期间，认证官通过实地走访、课堂观摩、座谈交流等形式，与学生、教师、家长及后勤团队代表深入互动，围绕 CIS 九大评估领域——愿景与方向、学校领导管理、课程设置、教学与评估、学生福祉、人员配置、校园设施及信息技术、社区与家校合作、住宿——进行了全面、细致的审查与评估。\n\n[IMAGE: 4]\n\n[IMAGE: 2]\n\n<iframe src="//player.bilibili.com/player.html?isOutside=true&aid=115342353433873&bvid=BV1B3x6ztE6Z&cid=32934658558&p=1" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe>\n\n### 热烈祝贺\n\n评估团队高度肯定了北京中学所秉承的“家”文化，以学生为中心的教育理念，以及注重创新与探索的学习氛围，充分认可学校在推动国际化教育方面取得的持续成果。\n\n2025 年 8 月，CIS 正式宣布北京中学顺利通过再认证（Re-Accreditation）。\n\n[IMAGE: 3]\n\n这一成果不仅标志着学校在办学理念、教育质量和管理水平上再次获得国际权威机构的高度认可，将为学生开拓更加广阔的国际交流平台、申请海外大学提供有力支持、链接更多全球优质教育资源。同时，这也将进一步推动并提升北京中学的现代化、国际化办学水平，助力学校培养具有全球视野和竞争力的未来人才。	4	4	3406762	2025-09-29 00:00:00	2026-03-31 00:32:41.057	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
