10	post	BAID Club Fair Concludes Successfully | 49 Student Clubs Ignite Campus Vibrancy!	BAID社团超市圆满落幕 | 49个社团点燃校园新活力！	BAID Club Fair Concludes Successfully | 49 Student Clubs Ignite Campus Vibrancy!	BAID社团超市圆满落幕 | 49个社团点燃校园新活力！	baid-club-fair-concludes-successfully-49-student-clubs-ignite-campus-vibrancy	With the cool autumn breeze marking the start of the new semester, the club life at Beijing Academy International Division (BAID) has once again kicked off spectacularly! Recently, the annual "Club Fair" recruitment event was held successfully. 49 unique Student Clubs gathered together, offering students a feast full of creativity and passion.\n\n## Event Highlights\n\n[IMAGE: 18]\n\n[IMAGE: 30]\n\n[IMAGE: 33]\n\nAs the class bell rang, students flocked to the event venue. Each club had meticulously arranged their booths, showcasing their distinctive activities, achievements, and future plans. From artistic creation to scientific research, from sports to community service, from cultural exchange to academic competitions... the diverse range of clubs provided every student with an opportunity to discover their interests and showcase their talents.\n\n## A Glimpse into the Clubs\n\n### 01 Arts & Creativity\n\n- **Art Grove**: Painting, design, lacquer fans, campus beautification... illuminating life with art.\n- **BA Personification Club**: Creating an anime IP for BA, bringing campus culture to life.\n- **Light Music Club**: ACG-themed band rehearsals, exploring music creation and performance.\n- **Film Production Workshop**: From screenwriting to editing, guiding you to complete your own short film.\n\n[IMAGE: 36]\n\n[IMAGE: 27]\n\n[IMAGE: 26]\n\n[IMAGE: 28]\n\n### 02 Academics & Technology\n\n- **AIBA Mathematics & AI Club**: Delving into AI algorithms and mathematical principles, hands-on project practice.\n- **Physics Unlimited**: Going beyond AP, challenging competitions, exploring the limitless possibilities of physics.\n- **Biology & Nature Club**: Preparing for USABO/BBO, uncovering the mysteries of life sciences.\n- **Neuroscience Club**: Dissecting pig brains, creating science videos, stepping into the world of the brain.\n\n[IMAGE: 39]\n\n[IMAGE: 41]\n\n[IMAGE: 21]\n\n### 03 Humanities & Society\n\n- **Symposium Club**: Philosophy, politics, gender, economics... questioning the truths of the world through discussion.\n- **Literature, History & Philosophy Seminar**: Cross-cultural in-depth discussions, producing academic papers and creative writing.\n- **BA Model United Nations Club**: Simulating UN conferences, cultivating global perspectives and negotiation skills.\n- **Chinese Debate Club**: Honing logic and expression, delivering brilliant debate performances.\n\n[IMAGE: 37]\n\n[IMAGE: 24]\n\n[IMAGE: 19]\n\n[IMAGE: 16]\n\n### 04 Sports & Wellness\n\n- **Volleyball Club**: Beginner-friendly instruction, aiming for inter-school leagues in the future.\n- **Ultimate Frisbee Club**: Non-contact, co-ed, building fitness and teamwork.\n- **Kinetic Energy Club**: Connecting sports and science, enhancing athletic performance and injury prevention.\n- **Lacrosse & Spartan Combined Club**: Challenging obstacle training, experiencing competitive spirit.\n\n[IMAGE: 20]\n\n### 05 Environment & Community Service\n\n- **Ecoshpere Environmental Science Club**: Promoting environmental awareness through 3D art installations, participating in international competitions.\n- **SLSD Sustainable Development Club**: Composting, climate board games, expert lectures, promoting a green campus.\n- **BAID Caring Hearts Club**: Stray cat rescue, book recycling, charity sales with creative products, spreading warmth through action.\n- **I-SEED**: Collecting campus improvement proposals, helping bring every great idea to life.\n\n[IMAGE: 35]\n\n[IMAGE: 38]\n\n[IMAGE: 25]\n\n### 06 Language & Culture\n\n- **Cantonese Club**: Ordering at tea restaurants, Cantonese songs and movies, experiencing Lingnan culture.\n- **Korean Club**: Weekly song sessions, dubbing games, snack tastings, learning Korean in a relaxed way.\n- **Cineclub**: One movie per month, discussing Chinese stories in English.\n- **Morning Star Creative Writing Club**: Taught by writers and screenwriters, creating a world-class writing camp.\n\n[IMAGE: 29]\n\n[IMAGE: 17]\n\n[IMAGE: 23]\n\n## Memorable Moments Recap\n\nThe event venue was bustling with activity. Students stopped at various booths for inquiries, while club leaders enthusiastically explained their offerings. Some clubs even brought live demonstrations: the Art Club showcased lacquer fan making, the Model Club displayed exquisitely painted works, the Electronic Music Club played original tracks, the Light Music Club performed impromptu pieces... the entire area was filled with energy and creativity.\n\n[IMAGE: 32]\n\n[IMAGE: 31]\n\n[IMAGE: 34]\n\n[IMAGE: 40]\n\nStudent Clubs are not just extensions of interests; they are platforms for skill development, broadening horizons, and building friendships. Whether in academic research, artistic creation, sports, or community service, every club embodies the spirit of "Growing through exploration, shining with passion."\n\n[IMAGE: 22]\n\nAlthough this Club Fair has concluded, the club journey for BAID students is just beginning. We look forward to students finding like-minded peers in their clubs, discovering their potential, reaping growth, and collectively writing your own brilliant chapters!	金秋送爽，新学期伊始，北京中学国际部的社团生活再次拉开精彩帷幕！近日，一年一度的“社团超市”招新活动成功举办。49 个各具特色的社团齐聚一堂，为同学们带来了一场充满创意与热情的盛宴。\n\n## 活动现场盛况\n\n[IMAGE: 18]\n\n[IMAGE: 30]\n\n[IMAGE: 33]\n\n下课铃响起，同学们纷纷涌向活动现场，每个社团都精心布置了展位，展示了各自的特色活动、成果和未来计划。从艺术创作到科学研究，从体育运动到公益服务，从文化交流到学术竞赛……丰富的社团选择，让每位同学都有机会发现兴趣、展现才华。\n\n## 社团风采一览\n\n### 01 艺术与创意类\n\n- **Art Grove 艺术社**：绘画设计、漆扇、校园美化……用艺术点亮生活。\n- **BA 校拟社**：打造属于 BA 的动漫 IP，让校园文化“活”起来。\n- **轻音部**：ACG 主题乐队排练，带你玩转音乐创作与演出。\n- **影视工作坊**：从编剧到剪辑，带你完成一部属于自己的短片。\n\n[IMAGE: 36]\n\n[IMAGE: 27]\n\n[IMAGE: 26]\n\n[IMAGE: 28]\n\n### 02 学术与科技类\n\n- **AIBA 北中数学与人工智能社**：深入 AI 算法与数学原理，动手实践项目。\n- **北中物理社 Physics Unlimited**：超越 AP，挑战竞赛，探索物理的无限可能。\n- **生物与自然社**：备战 USABO/BBO，探索生命科学的奥秘。\n- **神经科学社**：解剖猪脑、制作科普视频，走进大脑的世界。\n\n[IMAGE: 39]\n\n[IMAGE: 41]\n\n[IMAGE: 21]\n\n### 03 人文与社会类\n\n- **Symposium 会饮社**：哲学、政治、性别、经济……在讨论中追问世界的真相。\n- **文史哲研讨会**：跨文化深度研讨，产出学术论文与创意写作。\n- **北中模联社**：模拟联合国会议，培养国际视野与谈判能力。\n- **中文辩论社**：锻炼逻辑与表达，打出一场漂亮的辩论赛。\n\n[IMAGE: 37]\n\n[IMAGE: 24]\n\n[IMAGE: 19]\n\n[IMAGE: 16]\n\n### 04 体育与健康类\n\n- **排球社**：零基础教学，未来目标参加校际联赛。\n- **飞盘社**：无身体接触，男女混合，锻炼体能与团队配合。\n- **动能社**：连接运动与科学，提升运动表现与防伤能力。\n- **棍网球与斯巴达联合俱乐部**：挑战障碍训练，体验竞技精神。\n\n[IMAGE: 20]\n\n### 05 环保与公益类\n\n- **环境科学社 Ecoshpere**：用 3D 装置艺术宣传环保，参与国际竞赛。\n- **SLSD 可持续发展俱乐部**：堆肥、气候桌游、专家讲座，推动绿色校园。\n- **BAID 爱心社**：流浪猫救助、旧书循环、文创义卖，用行动传递温暖。\n- **I-SEED**：收集校园改进方案，助力每一个美好创意的落地。\n\n[IMAGE: 35]\n\n[IMAGE: 38]\n\n[IMAGE: 25]\n\n### 06 语言与文化类\n\n- **粤语社**：茶餐厅点餐、粤语歌电影，感受岭南文化。\n- **韩语社**：每周一歌、配音游戏、小吃体验，轻松学韩语。\n- **Cineclub**：每月一部电影，用英语讨论中国故事。\n- **启明星·创意写作社**：作家、编剧亲授，打造世界级写作营地。\n\n[IMAGE: 29]\n\n[IMAGE: 17]\n\n[IMAGE: 23]\n\n## 精彩瞬间回顾\n\n活动现场人头攒动，同学们在各个展位前驻足咨询，社长们热情讲解，有的社团还带来了现场演示：艺术社展示漆扇制作、模型社展出精美涂装作品、电子音乐社播放原创曲目、轻音部即兴演奏……整个场地充满了活力与创意。\n\n[IMAGE: 32]\n\n[IMAGE: 31]\n\n[IMAGE: 34]\n\n[IMAGE: 40]\n\n社团不仅是兴趣的延伸，更是能力锻炼、视野拓展、友谊建立的平台。无论是学术研究、艺术创作、体育运动还是公益服务，每一个社团都在用行动诠释着“在探索中成长，在热爱中发光”。\n\n[IMAGE: 22]\n\n本次社团超市虽已落幕，但属于北中学子的社团之旅才刚刚开始。期待同学们在社团中找到志同道合的伙伴，发掘潜能，收获成长，共同书写属于你们的精彩篇章！	With the cool autumn breeze marking the start of the new semester, the club life at Beijing Academy International Division (BAID) has once again kicked off spectacularly! Recently, the annual "Club Fair" recruitment event was held successfully. 49 unique Student Clubs gathered together, offering students a feast full of creativity and passion.\n\n## Event Highlights\n\n[IMAGE: 18]\n\n[IMAGE: 30]\n\n[IMAGE: 33]\n\nAs the class bell rang, students flocked to the event venue. Each club had meticulously arranged their booths, showcasing their distinctive activities, achievements, and future plans. From artistic creation to scientific research, from sports to community service, from cultural exchange to academic competitions... the diverse range of clubs provided every student with an opportunity to discover their interests and showcase their talents.\n\n## A Glimpse into the Clubs\n\n### 01 Arts & Creativity\n\n- **Art Grove**: Painting, design, lacquer fans, campus beautification... illuminating life with art.\n- **BA Personification Club**: Creating an anime IP for BA, bringing campus culture to life.\n- **Light Music Club**: ACG-themed band rehearsals, exploring music creation and performance.\n- **Film Production Workshop**: From screenwriting to editing, guiding you to complete your own short film.\n\n[IMAGE: 36]\n\n[IMAGE: 27]\n\n[IMAGE: 26]\n\n[IMAGE: 28]\n\n### 02 Academics & Technology\n\n- **AIBA Mathematics & AI Club**: Delving into AI algorithms and mathematical principles, hands-on project practice.\n- **Physics Unlimited**: Going beyond AP, challenging competitions, exploring the limitless possibilities of physics.\n- **Biology & Nature Club**: Preparing for USABO/BBO, uncovering the mysteries of life sciences.\n- **Neuroscience Club**: Dissecting pig brains, creating science videos, stepping into the world of the brain.\n\n[IMAGE: 39]\n\n[IMAGE: 41]\n\n[IMAGE: 21]\n\n### 03 Humanities & Society\n\n- **Symposium Club**: Philosophy, politics, gender, economics... questioning the truths of the world through discussion.\n- **Literature, History & Philosophy Seminar**: Cross-cultural in-depth discussions, producing academic papers and creative writing.\n- **BA Model United Nations Club**: Simulating UN conferences, cultivating global perspectives and negotiation skills.\n- **Chinese Debate Club**: Honing logic and expression, delivering brilliant debate performances.\n\n[IMAGE: 37]\n\n[IMAGE: 24]\n\n[IMAGE: 19]\n\n[IMAGE: 16]\n\n### 04 Sports & Wellness\n\n- **Volleyball Club**: Beginner-friendly instruction, aiming for inter-school leagues in the future.\n- **Ultimate Frisbee Club**: Non-contact, co-ed, building fitness and teamwork.\n- **Kinetic Energy Club**: Connecting sports and science, enhancing athletic performance and injury prevention.\n- **Lacrosse & Spartan Combined Club**: Challenging obstacle training, experiencing competitive spirit.\n\n[IMAGE: 20]\n\n### 05 Environment & Community Service\n\n- **Ecoshpere Environmental Science Club**: Promoting environmental awareness through 3D art installations, participating in international competitions.\n- **SLSD Sustainable Development Club**: Composting, climate board games, expert lectures, promoting a green campus.\n- **BAID Caring Hearts Club**: Stray cat rescue, book recycling, charity sales with creative products, spreading warmth through action.\n- **I-SEED**: Collecting campus improvement proposals, helping bring every great idea to life.\n\n[IMAGE: 35]\n\n[IMAGE: 38]\n\n[IMAGE: 25]\n\n### 06 Language & Culture\n\n- **Cantonese Club**: Ordering at tea restaurants, Cantonese songs and movies, experiencing Lingnan culture.\n- **Korean Club**: Weekly song sessions, dubbing games, snack tastings, learning Korean in a relaxed way.\n- **Cineclub**: One movie per month, discussing Chinese stories in English.\n- **Morning Star Creative Writing Club**: Taught by writers and screenwriters, creating a world-class writing camp.\n\n[IMAGE: 29]\n\n[IMAGE: 17]\n\n[IMAGE: 23]\n\n## Memorable Moments Recap\n\nThe event venue was bustling with activity. Students stopped at various booths for inquiries, while club leaders enthusiastically explained their offerings. Some clubs even brought live demonstrations: the Art Club showcased lacquer fan making, the Model Club displayed exquisitely painted works, the Electronic Music Club played original tracks, the Light Music Club performed impromptu pieces... the entire area was filled with energy and creativity.\n\n[IMAGE: 32]\n\n[IMAGE: 31]\n\n[IMAGE: 34]\n\n[IMAGE: 40]\n\nStudent Clubs are not just extensions of interests; they are platforms for skill development, broadening horizons, and building friendships. Whether in academic research, artistic creation, sports, or community service, every club embodies the spirit of "Growing through exploration, shining with passion."\n\n[IMAGE: 22]\n\nAlthough this Club Fair has concluded, the club journey for BAID students is just beginning. We look forward to students finding like-minded peers in their clubs, discovering their potential, reaping growth, and collectively writing your own brilliant chapters!	金秋送爽，新学期伊始，北京中学国际部的社团生活再次拉开精彩帷幕！近日，一年一度的“社团超市”招新活动成功举办。49 个各具特色的社团齐聚一堂，为同学们带来了一场充满创意与热情的盛宴。\n\n## 活动现场盛况\n\n[IMAGE: 18]\n\n[IMAGE: 30]\n\n[IMAGE: 33]\n\n下课铃响起，同学们纷纷涌向活动现场，每个社团都精心布置了展位，展示了各自的特色活动、成果和未来计划。从艺术创作到科学研究，从体育运动到公益服务，从文化交流到学术竞赛……丰富的社团选择，让每位同学都有机会发现兴趣、展现才华。\n\n## 社团风采一览\n\n### 01 艺术与创意类\n\n- **Art Grove 艺术社**：绘画设计、漆扇、校园美化……用艺术点亮生活。\n- **BA 校拟社**：打造属于 BA 的动漫 IP，让校园文化“活”起来。\n- **轻音部**：ACG 主题乐队排练，带你玩转音乐创作与演出。\n- **影视工作坊**：从编剧到剪辑，带你完成一部属于自己的短片。\n\n[IMAGE: 36]\n\n[IMAGE: 27]\n\n[IMAGE: 26]\n\n[IMAGE: 28]\n\n### 02 学术与科技类\n\n- **AIBA 北中数学与人工智能社**：深入 AI 算法与数学原理，动手实践项目。\n- **北中物理社 Physics Unlimited**：超越 AP，挑战竞赛，探索物理的无限可能。\n- **生物与自然社**：备战 USABO/BBO，探索生命科学的奥秘。\n- **神经科学社**：解剖猪脑、制作科普视频，走进大脑的世界。\n\n[IMAGE: 39]\n\n[IMAGE: 41]\n\n[IMAGE: 21]\n\n### 03 人文与社会类\n\n- **Symposium 会饮社**：哲学、政治、性别、经济……在讨论中追问世界的真相。\n- **文史哲研讨会**：跨文化深度研讨，产出学术论文与创意写作。\n- **北中模联社**：模拟联合国会议，培养国际视野与谈判能力。\n- **中文辩论社**：锻炼逻辑与表达，打出一场漂亮的辩论赛。\n\n[IMAGE: 37]\n\n[IMAGE: 24]\n\n[IMAGE: 19]\n\n[IMAGE: 16]\n\n### 04 体育与健康类\n\n- **排球社**：零基础教学，未来目标参加校际联赛。\n- **飞盘社**：无身体接触，男女混合，锻炼体能与团队配合。\n- **动能社**：连接运动与科学，提升运动表现与防伤能力。\n- **棍网球与斯巴达联合俱乐部**：挑战障碍训练，体验竞技精神。\n\n[IMAGE: 20]\n\n### 05 环保与公益类\n\n- **环境科学社 Ecoshpere**：用 3D 装置艺术宣传环保，参与国际竞赛。\n- **SLSD 可持续发展俱乐部**：堆肥、气候桌游、专家讲座，推动绿色校园。\n- **BAID 爱心社**：流浪猫救助、旧书循环、文创义卖，用行动传递温暖。\n- **I-SEED**：收集校园改进方案，助力每一个美好创意的落地。\n\n[IMAGE: 35]\n\n[IMAGE: 38]\n\n[IMAGE: 25]\n\n### 06 语言与文化类\n\n- **粤语社**：茶餐厅点餐、粤语歌电影，感受岭南文化。\n- **韩语社**：每周一歌、配音游戏、小吃体验，轻松学韩语。\n- **Cineclub**：每月一部电影，用英语讨论中国故事。\n- **启明星·创意写作社**：作家、编剧亲授，打造世界级写作营地。\n\n[IMAGE: 29]\n\n[IMAGE: 17]\n\n[IMAGE: 23]\n\n## 精彩瞬间回顾\n\n活动现场人头攒动，同学们在各个展位前驻足咨询，社长们热情讲解，有的社团还带来了现场演示：艺术社展示漆扇制作、模型社展出精美涂装作品、电子音乐社播放原创曲目、轻音部即兴演奏……整个场地充满了活力与创意。\n\n[IMAGE: 32]\n\n[IMAGE: 31]\n\n[IMAGE: 34]\n\n[IMAGE: 40]\n\n社团不仅是兴趣的延伸，更是能力锻炼、视野拓展、友谊建立的平台。无论是学术研究、艺术创作、体育运动还是公益服务，每一个社团都在用行动诠释着“在探索中成长，在热爱中发光”。\n\n[IMAGE: 22]\n\n本次社团超市虽已落幕，但属于北中学子的社团之旅才刚刚开始。期待同学们在社团中找到志同道合的伙伴，发掘潜能，收获成长，共同书写属于你们的精彩篇章！	34	34	3406762	2025-09-30 00:00:00	2025-10-14 05:58:10.629	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
34	page	College Counseling	大学升学指导	College Counseling	大学升学指导	academics/college-counseling	{"root":{"props":{"title":"College Counseling"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-c575365b-c13f-41e1-b31a-c716a6308cc5"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Find the college that's right for you","text":"Where academics, life, and ambitions come together, students can discover a path that truly fits—and move forward with confidence.","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-5aabc7eb-d8d8-4fc4-8569-2bba5c8e11b1"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-174ad903-b58b-4fcf-b74f-285bb36697df"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"College Counseling","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"topPadding":false,"id":"HeroConfig-753790ff-6e87-41b9-976a-ece0e306b6f1","resolvedImage":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"59"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-30b4144f-2819-4caf-b975-be3d4f4088e3"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Dream big at the universities that fit big dreams","text":"Since BAID was founded in 2017, students have received admissions offers from some of the world's leading universities, including Harvard, Stanford, the University of Pennsylvania, Caltech, Cornell, Brown, Oxford, Cambridge, the University of Melbourne, the University of Hong Kong, the University of Tokyo, and the University of Toronto.","to":"/temporary","linkText":"Our 2026 College Outcomes","id":"TopTextConfig-79a410b4-09b2-4f60-942c-4ae8a6cb737b"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-8947d4d0-6bea-4ace-a86f-c24867555a39"}},{"type":"ContainerConfig","props":{"children":[{"type":"HeadingConfig"