22	page	Academics	学术	Academics	学术	academics	{"root":{"props":{"title":"Academics"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-b1dd1dd9-9e83-43de-ba01-af3b984660cf"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"A better way to learn","text":"Taking advanced courses, diving into research, exploring Chinese culture, or even traveling across the nation and the world... At BAID, learning takes place where you could have never imagined.","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-f7e02ff9-50ec-42b3-8e6e-ce80b4aa2f71"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-93d5fd21-b509-476b-8316-814f3c50ecf4"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Academics","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"id":"HeroConfig-5ca9d628-f45d-425d-ba16-afca6a52c15c","resolvedImage":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"58"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-00ad96aa-b57d-41f6-8066-3626edaf2ae3"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"The Best of East and West","text":"BAID offers a dynamic curriculum that brings together the Chinese national curriculum, AP courses, and distinctive programs. Built on a strong academic foundation, it encourages interdisciplinary learning and individual growth, guiding students to explore real-world questions, form their own perspectives, and develop both broad vision and practical competence.","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-8e874d4e-be30-4eac-950e-8b55a0f8a68d"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-e1301155-4c93-485f-9c66-aaad9b6ffe36"}},{"type":"ParagraphConfig","props":{"size":"base","align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"color":"#000000","id":"ParagraphConfig-fb39e2ab-1ab7-452d-ba57-806118471454"}},{"type":"CurriculumConfig","props":{"title":"The BAID Curriculum","curricula":[{"title":"Foundation Courses","description":"Foundation courses serve students' comprehensive development by building a strong foundation in essential academic disciplines.","courses":[{"name":"Chinese Language Arts & Culture"},{"name":"English and World Languages"},{"name":"Core Mathematics"},{"name":"Core Sciences"},{"name":"Core Humanities"}]},{"title":"Enrichment Courses","description":"Enrichment courses serve students' diverse development by offering a broad range of incredible learning experiences.","courses":[{"name":"Academic Series"},{"name":"Experiential Series"},{"name":"Fine Arts Series"},{"name":"Fitness Series"},{"name":"Service Series"}]},{"title":"Talent Courses","description":"Talent courses serve student excellence by cultivating advanced abilities through leadership, innovation, and arts series.","courses":[{"name":"Leadership Series"},{"name":"Innovation Series"},{"name":"Arts Series"}]}],"id":"CurriculumConfig-909b205c-dc8a-4f76-879b-f822e10ccc40"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-f231dcea-083f-4ea1-9178-7b2341b1dab7"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-8a73049f-973d-4489-8b46-a829c3c742a1","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"Middle School","text":"Our middle school program is based on the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum, building strong foundations and inquiry skills.","image":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"},"link":"/academics/middle-school","linkText":"Middle School Program"},{"title":"High School","text":"Our high school program centers on AP courses, offering rigorous courses and focused academic pathways.","image":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"High School Program"},{"title":"Project-Based Learning","text":"At BAID, education is more than grades. Through our project-based learning curriculum, students develop their individual strengths beyond the classroom.\\n","image":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"},"link":"/academics/pbl","linkText":"Project-Based Learning"}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"title":"Middle School","image":"67","link":"/academics/middle-school","linkText":"Middle School Program","text":"Our middle school program is based on the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum, building strong foundations and inquiry skills."},{"title":"High School","image":"58","text":"Our high school program centers on AP courses, offering rigorous courses and focused academic pathways.","link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"High School Program"},{"title":"Project-Based Learning","image":"65","text":"At BAID, education is more than grades. Through our project-based learning curriculum, students develop their individual strengths beyond the classroom.\\n","link":"/academics/pbl","linkText":"Project-Based Learning"}]}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-55b3054a-c6f6-40f6-8149-ac76b11a7de1"}},{"type":"HeadingConfig","props":{"level":1,"size":"4xl","align":"center","bold":true,"italic":false,"color":"#000000","id":"HeadingConfig-9f9917f3-06b8-4176-a3c3-0a6b5e0db0b1","text":"Academics at BAID"}},{"type":"NewsListConfig","props":{"id":"NewsListConfig-a6d9fff4-27d2-4592-9bec-76c8bc0b5524","resolvedEntitiesInit":{"items":[],"page":0,"pages":0},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","category":"academics"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-0e466c9c-546b-405c-9c5e-bffd9c2b1493"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"学术"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-b1dd1dd9-9e83-43de-ba01-af3b984660cf"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"不一样的学习方式","text":"在 BAID，学习不止于课堂。无论是挑战高阶课程、深入科研实践，还是走进文化现场、行走于天地之间，处处皆课堂，时时可成长。","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-f7e02ff9-50ec-42b3-8e6e-ce80b4aa2f71"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-93d5fd21-b509-476b-8316-814f3c50ecf4"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Academics","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"id":"HeroConfig-5ca9d628-f45d-425d-ba16-afca6a52c15c","resolvedImage":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"58"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-00ad96aa-b57d-41f6-8066-3626edaf2ae3"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"中西合璧 博采群长","text":"BAID 打造了融合中国国家课程、AP 课程与特色项目的多元课程体系。在坚实学术基础之上，鼓励跨学科学习与个性发展，引导学生在真实情境中探索问题、提出见解，逐步形成开阔的视野与扎实的实践能力。","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-8e874d4e-be30-4eac-950e-8b55a0f8a68d"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-e1301155-4c93-485f-9c66-aaad9b6ffe36"}},{"type":"ParagraphConfig","props":{"size":"base","align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"color":"#000000","id":"ParagraphConfig-fb39e2ab-1ab7-452d-ba57-806118471454"}},{"type":"CurriculumConfig","props":{"title":"BAID 课程体系","curricula":[{"title":"基础课程","description":"基础课程服务于学生全面发展，夯实学生语文、英语、数学、科学与人文等核心学科基础。","courses":[{"name":"语文"},{"name":"核心英语"},{"name":"核心数学"},{"name":"核心科学"},{"name":"核心人文"}]},{"title":"拓展课程","description":"拓展课程服务于学生多元发展，提供「处处皆课堂，时时可成长」的学习机会。","courses":[{"name":"学院系列"},{"name":"阅历系列"},{"name":"雅趣系列"},{"name":"健身系列"},{"name":"服务系列"}]},{"title":"潜能课程","description":"潜能课程服务于学生卓越发展，培养学生领导力、创造力，及优势力。","courses":[{"name":"领导力系列"},{"name":"创造力系列 "},{"name":"优势力系列 "}]}],"id":"CurriculumConfig-909b205c-dc8a-4f76-879b-f822e10ccc40"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-f231dcea-083f-4ea1-9178-7b2341b1dab7"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-8a73049f-973d-4489-8b46-a829c3c742a1","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"初中项目","text":"初中课程以剑桥课程体系为基础，注重学科基础与探究学习，帮助学生建立清晰的知识结构与学习方法。","image":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"},"link":"/academics/middle-school","linkText":"初中项目"},{"title":"高中项目","text":"高中阶段以 AP 课程为主，为学生提供丰富、多元、有挑战性的课程选择，支持学生根据兴趣与方向开展深入学习。","image":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"高中项目"},{"title":"项目式学习","text":"多维素养的项目式学习课程支持学生不断拓宽视野、发掘兴趣、发展潜能，实现全面而有个性的成长。","image":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"},"link":"/academics/pbl","linkText":"项目式学习"}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"title":"初中项目","image":"67","link":"/academics/middle-school","linkText":"初中项目","text":"初中课程以剑桥课程体系为基础，注重学科基础与探究学习，帮助学生建立清晰的知识结构与学习方法。"},{"title":"高中项目","image":"58","text":"高中阶段以 AP 课程为主，为学生提供丰富、多元、有挑战性的课程选择，支持学生根据兴趣与方向开展深入学习。","link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"高中项目"},{"title":"项目式学习","image":"65","text":"多维素养的项目式学习课程支持学生不断拓宽视野、发掘兴趣、发展潜能，实现全面而有个性的成长。","link":"/academics/pbl","linkText":"项目式学习"}]}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-55b3054a-c6f6-40f6-8149-ac76b11a7de1"}},{"type":"HeadingConfig","props":{"level":1,"size":"4xl","align":"center","bold":true,"italic":false,"color":"#000000","id":"HeadingConfig-9f9917f3-06b8-4176-a3c3-0a6b5e0db0b1","text":"学术在 BAID"}},{"type":"NewsListConfig","props":{"id":"NewsListConfig-a6d9fff4-27d2-4592-9bec-76c8bc0b5524","resolvedEntitiesInit":{"items":[],"page":0,"pages":0},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","category":"academics"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-0e466c9c-546b-405c-9c5e-bffd9c2b1493"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"Academics"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-b1dd1dd9-9e83-43de-ba01-af3b984660cf"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"A better way to learn","text":"Taking advanced courses, diving into research, exploring Chinese culture, or even traveling across the nation and the world... At BAID, learning takes place where you could have never imagined.","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-f7e02ff9-50ec-42b3-8e6e-ce80b4aa2f71"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-93d5fd21-b509-476b-8316-814f3c50ecf4"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Academics","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"id":"HeroConfig-5ca9d628-f45d-425d-ba16-afca6a52c15c","resolvedImage":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"58"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-00ad96aa-b57d-41f6-8066-3626edaf2ae3"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"The Best of East and West","text":"BAID offers a dynamic curriculum that brings together the Chinese national curriculum, AP courses, and distinctive programs. Built on a strong academic foundation, it encourages interdisciplinary learning and individual growth, guiding students to explore real-world questions, form their own perspectives, and develop both broad vision and practical competence.","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-8e874d4e-be30-4eac-950e-8b55a0f8a68d"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-e1301155-4c93-485f-9c66-aaad9b6ffe36"}},{"type":"ParagraphConfig","props":{"size":"base","align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"color":"#000000","id":"ParagraphConfig-fb39e2ab-1ab7-452d-ba57-806118471454"}},{"type":"CurriculumConfig","props":{"title":"The BAID Curriculum","curricula":[{"title":"Foundation Courses","description":"Foundation courses serve students' comprehensive development by building a strong foundation in essential academic disciplines.","courses":[{"name":"Chinese Language Arts & Culture"},{"name":"English and World Languages"},{"name":"Core Mathematics"},{"name":"Core Sciences"},{"name":"Core Humanities"}]},{"title":"Enrichment Courses","description":"Enrichment courses serve students' diverse development by offering a broad range of incredible learning experiences.","courses":[{"name":"Academic Series"},{"name":"Experiential Series"},{"name":"Fine Arts Series"},{"name":"Fitness Series"},{"name":"Service Series"}]},{"title":"Talent Courses","description":"Talent courses serve student excellence by cultivating advanced abilities through leadership, innovation, and arts series.","courses":[{"name":"Leadership Series"},{"name":"Innovation Series"},{"name":"Arts Series"}]}],"id":"CurriculumConfig-909b205c-dc8a-4f76-879b-f822e10ccc40"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-f231dcea-083f-4ea1-9178-7b2341b1dab7"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-8a73049f-973d-4489-8b46-a829c3c742a1","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"Middle School","text":"Our m