33	page	Project-Based Learning	项目式学习	Project-Based Learning	项目式学习	academics/pbl	{"root":{"props":{"title":"Project-Based Learning"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Project-Based Learning","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","lightText":true,"topPadding":true,"id":"HeroConfig-4a883389-acce-4573-b3b5-b5c86b114a0f","resolvedImage":{"id":6,"sha1":"9942a41c5b79b01ed07566182c6e54e34b3079b7","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":6016,"height":3384,"sizeKB":1204,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:02:23.332Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"6"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-18108644-3509-4ee5-978e-ae7d21ac483f"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Learn by doing!","text":"At BAID, project-based learning brings ideas to life. Learning is more than just concepts—students at BAID ask bold questions, explore real issues, and create work that matters. Every student has the opportunity to complete at least two self-directed projects along the way.","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-c34d2b70-5385-48c8-b5c8-acb5adb9ba64"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-39df18c8-d06b-48ca-bdd9-8c56fd824409"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-dfb1418b-ebc7-4861-94c4-a3b05604568a","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"In the Classroom","text":"This spirit of inquiry runs through daily learning. In courses such as AP Seminar and AP Research, students dive into real-world topics, build strong research skills, and learn how to communicate original ideas with confidence and depth.","image":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"}},{"title":"Beyond the Classroom","text":" BAID opens the door to exceptional opportunities. Through partnerships with Communication University of China, Tsinghua University, and Beijing Normal University, students truly discover how far their interests can take them.","image":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"}},{"title":"Projects with Purpose","text":"BAID students also bring their ideas into the world around them. From accessibility to elder support, they launch projects that respond to real needs and create real impact. In doing so, they grow into thoughtful, capable innovators ready to make a difference.","image":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"title":"In the Classroom","image":"58","text":"This spirit of inquiry runs through daily learning. In courses such as AP Seminar and AP Research, students dive into real-world topics, build strong research skills, and learn how to communicate original ideas with confidence and depth."},{"title":"Beyond the Classroom","image":"65","text":" BAID opens the door to exceptional opportunities. Through partnerships with Communication University of China, Tsinghua University, and Beijing Normal University, students truly discover how far their interests can take them."},{"title":"Projects with Purpose","image":"59","text":"BAID students also bring their ideas into the world around them. From accessibility to elder support, they launch projects that respond to real needs and create real impact. In doing so, they grow into thoughtful, capable innovators ready to make a difference."}]}},{"type":"FeaturedProjectsConfig","props":{"title":"Featured Projects","id":"FeaturedProjectsConfig-fd5ddade-c72e-49ff-9b16-70175423bdb9","resolvedProjects":[{"quote":"Some inspiring quote from this featured project.","name":"Someone, Class of 2027","link":"","linkText":"了解创造与发现的故事","image":{"id":13,"sha1":"3deaf54f489a33abc0c47cfbc989afdc5645caf0","name":"test","altText":"test","width":2117,"height":2823,"sizeKB":456,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:24:36.595Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","projects":[{"project":{"id":3,"title":"奥里导航","createdAt":{},"slug":"orinav"},"quote":"Some inspiring quote from this featured project.","name":"Someone, Class of 2027","image":"13","linkText":"了解创造与发现的故事"}]}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-51b13424-9abf-4530-8477-f05e4a748e6d","resolvedImage":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","topText":"In the Classroom","title":"Project-Based Learning, Every Step of the Way","text":"From AP Seminar and AP Research to subject weeks and special projects in mathematics, physics, biology, chemistry, economics, and beyond, students are always asking, always exploring, and always creating. Through inquiry, collaboration, and presentation, learning becomes deeper, broader, and far more alive.","image":"58"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-5059946b-3d9e-444e-a055-cc49b0fc9472","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"62","topText":"Major Foundation Program","title":"Research, From Zero to One","text":"The Major Foundation Program (MFP) is one of BAID's signature platforms for student research. Starting with their own interests, students define their topics, develop research questions, and work closely with mentors one on one. Through literature review, research design, and experimentation, they build a project from the ground up and complete a high-quality academic paper of their own."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-ae743a9d-6531-4086-b7f6-8ccf5352a9be","resolvedImage":{"id":11,"sha1":"c3362d9dcace9926f10970230152d0d4869e1448","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":3840,"height":2563,"sizeKB":2517,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:01:29.874Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","topText":"Chinese Cultural Roots Journey","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74","image":"11","title":"Rooted in Culture, Learned on the Road","text":"The Chinese Cultural Roots Journey is a week-long, cross-regional learning experience that takes students beyond Beijing and into new parts of China. Guided by mentors and working in teams, students explore local history, culture, nature, and society through field study, observation, discussion, and presentation, gaining a wider view of the world and a deeper connection to Chinese culture in the process."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-034b482d-9f59-4a65-a560-3702b9b561ad","resolvedImage":{"id":63,"sha1":"eca52c9f86f2410f111503f970426e6a0c2bd94b","name":"Bejng Culture Exploration Program","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":853,"sizeKB":85,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:56.539Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","topText":"Beijing Cultural Exploration Program","title":"Reading Beijing, Past and Present","text":"The Beijing Cultural Exploration Program invites students to explore cultural heritage and history of the storied city we live in. With guidance from mentors, students conduct site visits, interviews, workshops, group projects, and final presentations, coming to see how Beijing's traditions continues to speak to the present.","image":"63"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-979200be-bdeb-45d0-af2e-4f701283c72e","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"62","topText":"Communication University of China","title":"Talent Scholar Program","text":"Offered in partnership with the Communication University of China, this year-long humanities and social science research program gives students the chance to complete original inquiry in fields such as communication, film anthropology, and anthropology. Guided by university faculty and graduate mentors, students move through the full research process, from reading and design to interviews, data analysis, writing, and presentation."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-58eb894c-61c1-41bf-ad37-9055e3b67904","resolvedImage":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"67","topText":"Tsinghua University","title":"Accessibility Development Rising Stars Program","text":"Developed in partnership with Tsinghua University's Institute for Accessibility Development, this year-long program centers on key issues such as universal design, assistive technology, social inclusion, and public service. Under faculty mentorship, students take on the full process of inquiry and creation: user interviews, problem analysis, solution design, prototyping, and final presentation."}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-5e0b1bd7-02b3-455a-b64a-b11245b8fda4"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"Learn more about student projects","link":"/projects","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-e7f80f70-fe3d-4fe7-9310-cb729c1755e4"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"1rem","id":"SpacerConfig-af49dfd7-92d1-4a25-bb45-f54e7946d239"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"Learn more about BAID's high school admissions","link":"/admissions/baid","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-7eb50f23-ceac-4c84-9d7a-a68ef2386ea9"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"1rem","id":"SpacerConfig-e497f345-b149-4806-a596-1169052d19cc"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"Learn more about ISBA's middle school admissions","link":"/admissions/isba","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-7ad6deaa-aece-4954-aef9-b22348b78f39"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-a6d8792a-364f-49b0-b76e-8d0742ec54cb"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"项目式学习"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Project-Based Learning","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","lightText":true,"topPadding":true,"id":"HeroConfig-4a883389-acce-4573-b3b5-b5c86b114a0f","resolvedImage":{"id":6,"sha1":"9942a41c5b79b01ed07566182c6e54e34b3079b7","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":6016,"height":3384,"sizeKB":1204,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:02:23.332Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"6"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-18108644-3509-4ee5-978e-ae7d21ac483f"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"在项目式学习中发展核心素养","text":"在 BAID，项目式学习是学业生活的重要组成部分。学生们有无限机会在真实问题中综合运用知识、开展探究、形成成果。每位学生都会在学业生涯中完成至少两个自主项目。","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-c34d2b70-5385-48c8-b5c8-acb5adb9ba64"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-39df18c8-d06b-48ca-bdd9-8c56fd824409"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-dfb1418b-ebc7-4861-94c4-a3b05604568a","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"校内课程","text":"项目式学习深度融入 BAID 的日常课程之中。在 AP Seminar、AP Research 等课程中，学生围绕真实议题开展研究、分析与表达，在持续探究中提升学术思维、研究能力与沟通能力。","image":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"}},{"title":"优质资源","text":"BAID 持续引入多元优质项目资源，为学生搭建更广阔的学习平台。Major Foundation Program 科研项目，以及中国传媒大学、清华大学、北京师范大学等合作项目，帮助学生走进更高水平的学术与实践场域，拓展认知边界，丰富学习体验。","image":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"}},{"title":"自主项目","text":"在 BAID，学生将世界因我更美好的理念落实到真实行动之中。他们围绕助残、助老等社会议题，自主发起并推进各类公益项目，在关注他人、服务社会的过程中提升责任意识、行动能力与公共关怀。","image":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"title":"校内课程","image":"58","text":"项目式学习深度融入 BAID 的日常课程之中。在 AP Seminar、AP Research 等课程中，学生围绕真实议题开展研究、分析与表达，在持续探究中提升学术思维、研究能力与沟通能力。"},{"title":"优质资源","image":"65","text":"BAID 持续引入多元优质项目资源，为学生搭建更广阔的学习平台。Major Foundation Program 科研项目，以及中国传媒大学、清华大学、北京师范大学等合作项目，帮助学生走进更高水平的学术与实践场域，拓展认知边界，丰富学习体验。"},{"title":"自主项目","image":"59","text":"在 BAID，学生将世界因我更美好的理念落实到真实行动之中。他们围绕助残、助老等社会议题，自主发起并推进各类公益项目，在关注他人、服务社会的过程中提升责任意识、行动能力与公共关怀。"}]}},{"type":"FeaturedProjectsConfig","props":{"title":"精选项目","id":"FeaturedProjectsConfig-fd5ddade-c72e-49ff-9b16-70175423bdb9","resolvedProjects":[{"quote":"精选项目展示内容","name":"Someone, 2027 届","link":"","linkText":"了解创造与发现的故事","image":{"id":13,"sha1":"3deaf54f489a33abc0c47cfbc989afdc5645caf0","name":"test","altText":"test","width":2117,"height":2823,"sizeKB":456,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:24:36.595Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","projects":[{"project":{"id":3,"title":"奥里导航","createdAt":{},"slug":"orinav"},"quote":"精选项目展示内容","name":"Someone, 2027 届","image":"13","linkText":"了解创造与发现的故事"}]}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-51b13424-9abf-4530-8477-f05e4a748e6d","resolvedImage":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","topText":"校内课程","title":"贯穿始终的项目式学习","text":"从 AP Seminar、AP Research 的研究性学习，到数学、物理、生物、化学、经济等学科的学科周活动与专题项目，学生在持续探究、合作实践与成果展示中不断深化理解、拓展能力。","image":"58"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-5059946b-3d9e-444e-a055-cc49b0fc9472","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"62","topText":"Major Foundation Program","title":"每一位学生从零到一的科研项目","text":"Major Foundation Program (MFP) 是北京中学重要的项目式学习平台。在这一项目中，学生立足自身兴趣与专业方向，自主确定研究主题，在导师一对一指导下提出可探究的问题，并通过文献检索、研究设计、科学实验等方式开展系统研究，最终形成高质量的学术论文。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-ae743a9d-6531-4086-b7f6-8ccf5352a9be","resolvedImage":{"id":11,"sha1":"c3362d9dcace9926f10970230152d0d4869e1448","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":3840,"height":2563,"sizeKB":2517,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:01:29.874Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","topText":"中华文化寻根之旅","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74","image":"11","title":"在行走中理解文化，在体验中拓展认知","text":"「中华文化寻根之旅 · 阅历课程」以为期一周的跨地域学习为主要形式，学生前往外省，在导师指导下组队开展文化探究与实地研究。课程围绕当地历史、人文、自然与社会主题展开，学生通过参访、观察、记录、讨论与展示，形成课题报告，在真实情境中深化理解、拓展视野。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-034b482d-9f59-4a65-a560-3702b9b561ad","resolvedImage":{"id":63,"sha1":"eca52c9f86f2410f111503f970426e6a0c2bd94b","name":"Bejng Culture Exploration Program","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":853,"sizeKB":85,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:56.539Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","topText":"北京文化探究项目","title":"在北京城韵中理解传统与当下","text":"北京文化探究项目围绕非遗、历史、城市记忆与文化传承等主题展开，学生在导师指导下，通过实地考察、访谈调研、设计思维工作坊、小组合作与成果展示等方式，深入理解北京文化的内涵，让传统文化在当代焕发新的生命力。","image":"63"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-979200be-bdeb-45d0-af2e-4f701283c72e","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"62","topText":"中国传媒大学","title":"英才学者项目","text":"英才学者项目是北京中学国际部与中国传媒大学合作开展的为期一年的人文社科研究项目。学生在高校专家导师与研究生助教的指导下，围绕传播学、影视人类学、人类学等方向自主选题，系统完成文献阅读、研究设计、问卷与访谈、数据分析、论文写作与成果展示等完整研究过程。课程以真实学术训练为核心，在持续探究中形成更深入的问题意识与人文视野。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-58eb894c-61c1-41bf-ad37-9055e3b67904","resolvedImage":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"67","topText":"清华大学","title":"无障碍发展 \\"未来星\\" 培养计划","text":"无障碍发展 \\"未来星\\" 培养计划是北京中学国际部与清华大学无障碍发展研究院合作开展的为期一年培养项目。学生围绕无障碍设计、辅助技术、社会包容与公共服务等真实议题，在高校导师指导下开展系统学习与实践研究，完整经历用户访谈、问题分析、方案设计、原型制作、项目答辩等过程。项目注重设计、技术、社会关怀等多领域融合，帮助学生提升跨学科探究能力、创新能力与责任意识，在真实场景中理解无障碍发展的价值，并以实际行动回应社会需求。"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-5e0b1bd7-02b3-455a-b64a-b11245b8fda4"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"了解更多学生项目","link":"/projects","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-e7f80f70-fe3d-4fe7-9310-cb729c1755e4"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"1rem","id":"SpacerConfig-af49dfd7-92d1-4a25-bb45-f54e7946d239"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"了解 BAID 的高中招生项目","link":"/admissions/baid","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-7eb50f23-ceac-4c84-9d7a-a68ef2386ea9"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"1rem","id":"SpacerConfig-e497f345-b149-4806-a596-1169052d19cc"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"了解 ISBA 的初中招生项目","link":"/admissions/isba","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-7ad6deaa-aece-4954-aef9-b22348b78f39"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-a6d8792a-364f-49b0-b76e-8d0742ec54cb"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"Project-Based Learning"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Project-Based Learning","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","lightText":true,"topPadding":true,"id":"HeroConfig-4a883389-acce-4573-b3b5-b5c86b114a0f","resolvedImage":{"id":6,"sha1":"9942a41c5b79b01ed07566182c6e54e34b3079b7","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":6016,"height":3384,"sizeKB":1204,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:02:23.332Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"6"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-18108644-3509-4ee5-978e-ae7d21ac483f"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Learn by doing!","text":"At BAID, project-based learning brings ideas to life. Learning is more than just concepts—students at BAID ask bold questions, explore real issues, and create work that matters. Every student has the opportunity to complete at least two self-directed projects along the way.","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-c34d2b70-5385-48c8-b5c8-acb5adb9ba64"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-39df18c8-d06b-48ca-bdd9-8c56fd824409"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-dfb1418b-ebc7-4861-94c4-a3b05604568a","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"In the Classroom","text":"This spirit of inquiry runs through daily learning. In courses such as AP Seminar and AP Research, students dive into real-world topics, build strong research skills, and learn how to communicate original ideas with confidence and depth.","image":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"}},{"title":"Beyond the Classroom","text":" BAID opens the door to exceptional opportunities. Through partnerships with Communication University of China, Tsinghua University, and Beijing Normal University, students truly discover how far their interests can take them.","image":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"}},{"title":"Projects with Purpose","text":"BAID students also bring their ideas into the world around them. From accessibility to elder support, they launch projects that respond to real needs and create real impact. In doing so, they grow into thoughtful, capable innovators ready to make a difference.","image":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"title":"In the Classroom","image":"58","text":"This spirit of inquiry runs through daily learning. In courses such as AP Seminar and AP Research, students dive into real-world topics, build strong research skills, and learn how to communicate original ideas with confidence and depth."},{"title":"Beyond the Classroom","image":"65","text":" BAID opens the door to exceptional opportunities. Through partnerships with Communication University of China, Tsinghua University, and Beijing Normal University, students truly discover how far their interests can take them."},{"title":"Projects with Purpose","image":"59","text":"BAID students also bring their ideas into the world around them. From accessibility to elder support, they launch projects that respond to real needs and create real impact. In doing so, they grow into thoughtful, capable innovators ready to make a difference."}]}},{"type":"FeaturedProjectsConfig","props":{"title":"Featured Projects","id":"FeaturedProjectsConfig-fd5ddade-c72e-49ff-9b16-70175423bdb9","resolvedProjects":[{"quote":"Some inspiring quote from this featured project.","name":"Someone, Class of 2027","link":"","linkText":"了解创造与发现的故事","image":{"id":13,"sha1":"3deaf54f489a33abc0c47cfbc989afdc5645caf0","name":"test","altText":"test","width":2117,"height":2823,"sizeKB":456,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:24:36.595Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","projects":[{"project":{"id":3,"title":"奥里导航","createdAt":{},"slug":"orinav"},"quote":"Some inspiring quote from this featured project.","name":"Someone, Class of 2027","image":"13","linkText":"了解创造与发现的故事"}]}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-51b13424-9abf-4530-8477-f05e4a748e6d","resolvedImage":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","topText":"In the Classroom","title":"Project-Based Learning, Every Step of the Way","text":"From AP Seminar and AP Research to subject weeks and special projects in mathematics, physics, biology, chemistry, economics, and beyond, students are always asking, always exploring, and always creating. Through inquiry, collaboration, and presentation, learning becomes deeper, broader, and far more alive.","image":"58"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-5059946b-3d9e-444e-a055-cc49b0fc9472","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"62","topText":"Major Foundation Program","title":"Research, From Zero to One","text":"The Major Foundation Program (MFP) is one of BAID's signature platforms for student research. Starting with their own interests, students define their topics, develop research questions, and work closely with mentors one on one. Through literature review, research design, and experimentation, they build a project from the ground up and complete a high-quality academic paper of their own."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-ae743a9d-6531-4086-b7f6-8ccf5352a9be","resolvedImage":{"id":11,"sha1":"c3362d9dcace9926f10970230152d0d4869e1448","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":3840,"height":2563,"sizeKB":2517,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:01:29.874Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","topText":"Chinese Cultural Roots Journey","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74","image":"11","title":"Rooted in Culture, Learned on the Road","text":"The Chinese Cultural Roots Journey is a week-long, cross-regional learning experience that takes students beyond Beijing and into new parts of China. Guided by mentors and working in teams, students explore local history, culture, nature, and society through field study, observation, discussion, and presentation, gaining a wider view of the world and a deeper connection to Chinese culture in the process."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-034b482d-9f59-4a65-a560-3702b9b561ad","resolvedImage":{"id":63,"sha1":"eca52c9f86f2410f111503f970426e6a0c2bd94b","name":"Bejng Culture Exploration Program","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":853,"sizeKB":85,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:56.539Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","topText":"Beijing Cultural Exploration Program","title":"Reading Beijing, Past and Present","text":"The Beijing Cultural Exploration Program invites students to explore cultural heritage and history of the storied city we live in. With guidance from mentors, students conduct site visits, interviews, workshops, group projects, and final presentations, coming to see how Beijing's traditions continues to speak to the present.","image":"63"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-979200be-bdeb-45d0-af2e-4f701283c72e","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"62","topText":"Communication University of China","title":"Talent Scholar Program","text":"Offered in partnership with the Communication University of China, this year-long humanities and social science research program gives students the chance to complete original inquiry in fields such as communication, film anthropology, and anthropology. Guided by university faculty and graduate mentors, students move through the full research process, from reading and design to interviews, data analysis, writing, and presentation."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-58eb894c-61c1-41bf-ad37-9055e3b67904","resolvedImage":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"67","topText":"Tsinghua University","title":"Accessibility Development Rising Stars Program","text":"Developed in partnership with Tsinghua University's Institute for Accessibility Development, this year-long program centers on key issues such as universal design, assistive technology, social inclusion, and public service. Under faculty mentorship, students take on the full process of inquiry and creation: user interviews, problem analysis, solution design, prototyping, and final presentation."}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-5e0b1bd7-02b3-455a-b64a-b11245b8fda4"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"Learn more about student projects","link":"/projects","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-e7f80f70-fe3d-4fe7-9310-cb729c1755e4"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"1rem","id":"SpacerConfig-af49dfd7-92d1-4a25-bb45-f54e7946d239"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"Learn more about BAID's high school admissions","link":"/admissions/baid","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-7eb50f23-ceac-4c84-9d7a-a68ef2386ea9"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"1rem","id":"SpacerConfig-e497f345-b149-4806-a596-1169052d19cc"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"Learn more about ISBA's middle school admissions","link":"/admissions/isba","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-7ad6deaa-aece-4954-aef9-b22348b78f39"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-a6d8792a-364f-49b0-b76e-8d0742ec54cb"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"项目式学习"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Project-Based Learning","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","lightText":true,"topPadding":true,"id":"HeroConfig-4a883389-acce-4573-b3b5-b5c86b114a0f","resolvedImage":{"id":6,"sha1":"9942a41c5b79b01ed07566182c6e54e34b3079b7","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":6016,"height":3384,"sizeKB":1204,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:02:23.332Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"6"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-18108644-3509-4ee5-978e-ae7d21ac483f"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"在项目式学习中发展核心素养","text":"在 BAID，项目式学习是学业生活的重要组成部分。学生们有无限机会在真实问题中综合运用知识、开展探究、形成成果。每位学生都会在学业生涯中完成至少两个自主项目。","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-c34d2b70-5385-48c8-b5c8-acb5adb9ba64"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-39df18c8-d06b-48ca-bdd9-8c56fd824409"}},{"type":"HighlightsConfig","props":{"id":"HighlightsConfig-dfb1418b-ebc7-4861-94c4-a3b05604568a","resolvedHighlights":[{"title":"校内课程","text":"项目式学习深度融入 BAID 的日常课程之中。在 AP Seminar、AP Research 等课程中，学生围绕真实议题开展研究、分析与表达，在持续探究中提升学术思维、研究能力与沟通能力。","image":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"}},{"title":"优质资源","text":"BAID 持续引入多元优质项目资源，为学生搭建更广阔的学习平台。Major Foundation Program 科研项目，以及中国传媒大学、清华大学、北京师范大学等合作项目，帮助学生走进更高水平的学术与实践场域，拓展认知边界，丰富学习体验。","image":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"}},{"title":"自主项目","text":"在 BAID，学生将世界因我更美好的理念落实到真实行动之中。他们围绕助残、助老等社会议题，自主发起并推进各类公益项目，在关注他人、服务社会的过程中提升责任意识、行动能力与公共关怀。","image":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","highlights":[{"title":"校内课程","image":"58","text":"项目式学习深度融入 BAID 的日常课程之中。在 AP Seminar、AP Research 等课程中，学生围绕真实议题开展研究、分析与表达，在持续探究中提升学术思维、研究能力与沟通能力。"},{"title":"优质资源","image":"65","text":"BAID 持续引入多元优质项目资源，为学生搭建更广阔的学习平台。Major Foundation Program 科研项目，以及中国传媒大学、清华大学、北京师范大学等合作项目，帮助学生走进更高水平的学术与实践场域，拓展认知边界，丰富学习体验。"},{"title":"自主项目","image":"59","text":"在 BAID，学生将世界因我更美好的理念落实到真实行动之中。他们围绕助残、助老等社会议题，自主发起并推进各类公益项目，在关注他人、服务社会的过程中提升责任意识、行动能力与公共关怀。"}]}},{"type":"FeaturedProjectsConfig","props":{"title":"精选项目","id":"FeaturedProjectsConfig-fd5ddade-c72e-49ff-9b16-70175423bdb9","resolvedProjects":[{"quote":"精选项目展示内容","name":"Someone, 2027 届","link":"","linkText":"了解创造与发现的故事","image":{"id":13,"sha1":"3deaf54f489a33abc0c47cfbc989afdc5645caf0","name":"test","altText":"test","width":2117,"height":2823,"sizeKB":456,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:24:36.595Z"}}],"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","projects":[{"project":{"id":3,"title":"奥里导航","createdAt":{},"slug":"orinav"},"quote":"精选项目展示内容","name":"Someone, 2027 届","image":"13","linkText":"了解创造与发现的故事"}]}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-51b13424-9abf-4530-8477-f05e4a748e6d","resolvedImage":{"id":58,"sha1":"bf11bcc1a751cd8727e990649683c7963fffb0ca","name":"Academics Hero","altText":"People studying around a table","width":3000,"height":2000,"sizeKB":172,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:44:30.095Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","topText":"校内课程","title":"贯穿始终的项目式学习","text":"从 AP Seminar、AP Research 的研究性学习，到数学、物理、生物、化学、经济等学科的学科周活动与专题项目，学生在持续探究、合作实践与成果展示中不断深化理解、拓展能力。","image":"58"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-5059946b-3d9e-444e-a055-cc49b0fc9472","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"62","topText":"Major Foundation Program","title":"每一位学生从零到一的科研项目","text":"Major Foundation Program (MFP) 是北京中学重要的项目式学习平台。在这一项目中，学生立足自身兴趣与专业方向，自主确定研究主题，在导师一对一指导下提出可探究的问题，并通过文献检索、研究设计、科学实验等方式开展系统研究，最终形成高质量的学术论文。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-ae743a9d-6531-4086-b7f6-8ccf5352a9be","resolvedImage":{"id":11,"sha1":"c3362d9dcace9926f10970230152d0d4869e1448","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":3840,"height":2563,"sizeKB":2517,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T05:01:29.874Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","topText":"中华文化寻根之旅","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74","image":"11","title":"在行走中理解文化，在体验中拓展认知","text":"「中华文化寻根之旅 · 阅历课程」以为期一周的跨地域学习为主要形式，学生前往外省，在导师指导下组队开展文化探究与实地研究。课程围绕当地历史、人文、自然与社会主题展开，学生通过参访、观察、记录、讨论与展示，形成课题报告，在真实情境中深化理解、拓展视野。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-034b482d-9f59-4a65-a560-3702b9b561ad","resolvedImage":{"id":63,"sha1":"eca52c9f86f2410f111503f970426e6a0c2bd94b","name":"Bejng Culture Exploration Program","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":853,"sizeKB":85,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:56.539Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","topText":"北京文化探究项目","title":"在北京城韵中理解传统与当下","text":"北京文化探究项目围绕非遗、历史、城市记忆与文化传承等主题展开，学生在导师指导下，通过实地考察、访谈调研、设计思维工作坊、小组合作与成果展示等方式，深入理解北京文化的内涵，让传统文化在当代焕发新的生命力。","image":"63"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-979200be-bdeb-45d0-af2e-4f701283c72e","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"62","topText":"中国传媒大学","title":"英才学者项目","text":"英才学者项目是北京中学国际部与中国传媒大学合作开展的为期一年的人文社科研究项目。学生在高校专家导师与研究生助教的指导下，围绕传播学、影视人类学、人类学等方向自主选题，系统完成文献阅读、研究设计、问卷与访谈、数据分析、论文写作与成果展示等完整研究过程。课程以真实学术训练为核心，在持续探究中形成更深入的问题意识与人文视野。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-58eb894c-61c1-41bf-ad37-9055e3b67904","resolvedImage":{"id":67,"sha1":"97e9fc13e8bc414ec93c58b64d599ba5ca85b7df","name":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","altText":"Buldng of Dongba Campus","width":3840,"height":2560,"sizeKB":1108,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:57:44.403Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"67","topText":"清华大学","title":"无障碍发展 \\"未来星\\" 培养计划","text":"无障碍发展 \\"未来星\\" 培养计划是北京中学国际部与清华大学无障碍发展研究院合作开展的为期一年培养项目。学生围绕无障碍设计、辅助技术、社会包容与公共服务等真实议题，在高校导师指导下开展系统学习与实践研究，完整经历用户访谈、问题分析、方案设计、原型制作、项目答辩等过程。项目注重设计、技术、社会关怀等多领域融合，帮助学生提升跨学科探究能力、创新能力与责任意识，在真实场景中理解无障碍发展的价值，并以实际行动回应社会需求。"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-5e0b1bd7-02b3-455a-b64a-b11245b8fda4"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"了解更多学生项目","link":"/projects","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-e7f80f70-fe3d-4fe7-9310-cb729c1755e4"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"1rem","id":"SpacerConfig-af49dfd7-92d1-4a25-bb45-f54e7946d239"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"了解 BAID 的高中招生项目","link":"/admissions/baid","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-7eb50f23-ceac-4c84-9d7a-a68ef2386ea9"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"1rem","id":"SpacerConfig-e497f345-b149-4806-a596-1169052d19cc"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"了解 ISBA 的初中招生项目","link":"/admissions/isba","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-7ad6deaa-aece-4954-aef9-b22348b78f39"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-a6d8792a-364f-49b0-b76e-8d0742ec54cb"}}],"zones":{}}	\N	\N	3406762	2026-03-20 03:12:38.194	2026-04-05 03:55:21.356	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
31	page	Middle School Program	初中项目	Middle School Program	初中项目	academics/middle-school	{"root":{"props":{"title":"Middle School Program"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-3a2fc548-1d42-4a66-b4b4-6e2b9577d15d"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Curious minds. Strong foundations. Ready for what's next.","text":"The middle school program builds knowledge, honors individuality, and encourages exploration, helping students grow into capable, thoughtful, and responsible young minds.","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-05723633-03a2-48f8-90c8-feb3d64952c1"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-81d123d9-11f7-4594-a861-4c25827790bd"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Middle School","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"topPadding":false,"id":"HeroConfig-3e23efda-546f-40a8-98dd-7b0f4df2967c","resolvedImage":{"id":64,"sha1":"15f6901d80775583c340abba2d020f0ce28fbeb6","name":"Life at BAID","altText":"People playing football on the playground","width":3976,"height":2652,"sizeKB":431,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:05:12.808Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"64"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-f8d9446c-b9a1-40c8-b09b-b05f7ff0e13b"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Unlock your potential","text":"The International School of Beijing Academy (ISBA) middle school program brings together China's national curriculum and the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum to create a learning experience that is both structured and forward-looking. With a strong focus on academic foundations, thinking skills, and language development, our program helps students build sound study habits, a solid base of knowledge, and an open global perspective. Through these years of growth and preparation, students are ready to step confidently into the rigor and challenge of AP courses in high school.","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-66ff8c03-4b29-403f-a022-c535c47e680b"}},{"type":"StatisticsConfig","props":{"title":"ISBA in Numbers","content":[{"name":"teacher-student ratio","value":"1:7"},{"name":"core STEAM courses","value":"9"},{"name":"average homeroom size","value":"~20"},{"name":"Cambridge academic courses","value":"13"},{"value":"40+","name":"outstanding electives"},{"value":"50+","name":"student clubs"}],"id":"StatisticsConfig-ade994f3-f4be-4293-86b8-7cc7c2e344f5"}},{"type":"CoursesConfig","props":{"title":"Courses Overview","id":"CoursesConfig-efe83e44-a6b8-496e-9ca2-bf2570f4c878","resolvedCourses":{"National Curriculum":[{"id":23,"type":"course","titlePublishedEN":"Chinese Literature","titlePublishedZH":"语文","titleDraftEN":"Chinese Literature","titleDraftZH":"语文","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishedZH":null,"shortContentDraftEN":null,"shortContentDraftZH":null,"slug":"chinese-literature","categoryEN":"National Curriculum","categoryZH":"国家课程","coverImagePublished":null,"coverImageDraft":null,"creator":{"id":3406762,"name":"蔺东来 Lin","pinyin":"Lin Donglai","roles":["admin","writer","editor"],"type":"student","gender":"male","createdAt":"2025-10-09T00:27:24.124Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T12:22:16.336Z"},"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:04.088Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:20.092Z"}],"AP":[{"id":24,"type":"course","titlePublishedEN":"AP Biology","titlePublishedZH":"AP 生物","titleDraftEN":"AP Biology","titleDraftZH":"AP 生物","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishedZH":null,"shortContentDraftEN":null,"shortContentDraftZH":null,"slug":"ap-biology","categoryEN":"AP","categoryZH":"AP","coverImagePublished":null,"coverImageDraft":null,"creator":{"id":3406762,"name":"蔺东来 Lin","pinyin":"Lin Donglai","roles":["admin","writer","editor"],"type":"student","gender":"male","createdAt":"2025-10-09T00:27:24.124Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T12:22:16.336Z"},"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:27.629Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:46.782Z"}]}}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-d9407734-920d-45c8-9e2c-fca57d2f56cb","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66","topText":"Core Curriculum","title":"Personalized Academic Growth, Supported by Cambridge","text":"At ISBA, the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum plays a central role in our academic program that is rigorous, well-rounded, and full of possibility. Thirteen core courses span Chinese, mathematics, English, science, humanities, and the arts, giving students a strong foundation while opening the door to wider exploration."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-b8e8e10c-b164-4391-96cb-1fb1beeb0ba7","resolvedImage":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"65","topText":"Bilingual Classroom","text":"At ISBA, bilingual learning is part of everyday classroom and campus life. Our students and teachers come from 7 countries and regions, bringing diverse perspectives into every class. Moving naturally between Chinese and English, students learn to express ideas clearly, work across cultures, and develop the confidence and openness to thrive in a global setting.\\n","title":"Bilingual Learning, Global Fluency"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-a9bc3ab7-474b-4786-a18b-a944929b5d23","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66","topText":"Leadership","title":"Leadership, Built Through Action","text":"We believe leadership grows through real responsibility. Every student has opportunities to step forward, contribute, and lead. Whether in the Student Council, the classroom, clubs, electives, or projects, students take on meaningful roles and learn by doing. Through each experience, they build judgment, collaboration, and grow into people ready to listen, decide, and take responsibility.","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-08d4de00-af67-4bb4-8521-e503bdec244d","resolvedImage":{"id":45,"sha1":"77f4b800de9217193844ea2f3bbe6b7e33a886b4","name":"微信导入","altText":"由微信文章导入","width":832,"height":554,"sizeKB":38,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T09:25:34.464Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","image":"45","topText":"Interdisciplinary Learning","title":"The World in My Heart","text":"At ISBA, interdisciplinary learning brings knowledge to life. Students are encouraged to connect ideas across subjects, work through real challenges, and learn by doing. Nine signature STEAM courses invite them to explore where science, humanities, art, and technology meet. At the same time, courses centered on global issues, the humanities, and design support students in their engagement with the world around them.\\n"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-9b4339f9-31ea-4b33-83bf-a1a28b5b38be","resolvedImage":{"id":63,"sha1":"eca52c9f86f2410f111503f970426e6a0c2bd94b","name":"Bejng Culture Exploration Program","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":853,"sizeKB":85,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:56.539Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"63","topText":"From China to the World","title":"Chinese Foundations, Global Dialogue","text":"At ISBA, we are first and foremost a Chinese school. Through programs such as the Beijing Cultural Exploration Program and the Chinese Cultural Roots Journey, students strengthen their cultural identity as Chinese peoples. At the same time, ISBA continues to expand the classroom beyond borders, with opportunities for students to study and connect with schools overseas, broaden their perspective, and engage the world with greater understanding.","linkText":"Discover global opportunities at ISBA","link":"/academics/pbl"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-89e7f650-fce5-45fb-b357-5085cd8aeb96","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","topText":"Beyond the Classroom","image":"62","text":"Through a rich mix of courses, activities, and platforms, students are encouraged to explore widely and grow with purpose. More than 40 electives and over 50 student-led clubs span music, visual arts, performing arts, science, the humanities, and athletics. Programs and activities such as Into Nature, BAID Stage, and BAID Speaker give students infinite possibilities to design, express, and discover.","title":"More to Try, More to Love","link":"/life","linkText":"Learn about life beyond the classroom at ISBA"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-334833eb-7126-4828-b891-157eab5bb851","resolvedImage":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74","title":"Better Me, Better World","topText":"Global Citizenship","image":"59","text":"At ISBA, service is a meaningful way students live out their role as active global citizens. Our students support left-behind children in urban villages, design navigation software for people with visual impairments, organize charity concerts, and bring greater attention to issues such as global hunger. Through real actions, our belief of \\"Better Me, Better World\\" becomes our way of living.","link":"/projects","linkText":"Visit our student projects gallery"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-3cb24aa8-7b15-4ca9-ba51-52b701a00121","resolvedImage":{"id":6,"sha1":"9942a41c5b79b01ed07566182c6e54e34b3079b7","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":6016,"height":3384,"sizeKB":1204,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:02:23.332Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","topText":"High School Program","image":"6","link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"Discover our high school program","title":"A Strong Foundation for High School and Beyond","text":"Built on China's national curriculum and the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum, the ISBA middle school program places strong emphasis on academic rigor and thoughtful preparation. Students develop a solid grasp of core subjects, build strong study habits, and learn clear, effective ways to approach their work. By the time they move into high school, they will have been already well prepared for our rigorous AP curriculum."}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-5746387e-05e4-4ffe-817e-98a99b707e7c"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"Learn more about ISBA's middle school admissions","link":"/admissions/isba","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-f611e007-29ee-4896-9954-7d6d48f7687d"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-aa1849aa-ee82-48a8-9d15-b220f39c03f0"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"初中项目"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-3a2fc548-1d42-4a66-b4b4-6e2b9577d15d"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"乐学善思、全面发展的未来少年","text":"初中课程体系注重基础、尊重个性、鼓励探究，帮助学生在真实而丰富的学习体验中不断提升自我，成长为有理想、有能力、有担当的少年。","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-05723633-03a2-48f8-90c8-feb3d64952c1"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-81d123d9-11f7-4594-a861-4c25827790bd"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Middle School","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"topPadding":false,"id":"HeroConfig-3e23efda-546f-40a8-98dd-7b0f4df2967c","resolvedImage":{"id":64,"sha1":"15f6901d80775583c340abba2d020f0ce28fbeb6","name":"Life at BAID","altText":"People playing football on the playground","width":3976,"height":2652,"sizeKB":431,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:05:12.808Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"64"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-f8d9446c-b9a1-40c8-b09b-b05f7ff0e13b"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"发展少年的无限潜能","text":"北中外籍人员子女学校 (International School of Beijing Academy, ISBA) 初中项目，融合中国国家课程与剑桥国际初中课程，为学生提供兼具系统性与发展性的学习体验。课程注重学科基础、思维训练与语言能力的全面提升，帮助学生在初中阶段逐步建立良好的学习习惯、扎实的知识结构与开放的国际视野。通过这一阶段的充分积累，学生将为进入高中阶段高标准、高要求的美国大学先修课程 (AP) 做好准备，在未来的学术挑战中更加自信从容。","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-66ff8c03-4b29-403f-a022-c535c47e680b"}},{"type":"StatisticsConfig","props":{"title":"从数字看 ISBA","content":[{"name":"师生比","value":"1:7"},{"name":"特色 STEAM 课程","value":"9"},{"name":"班额","value":"~20"},{"name":"可选核心学术课程","value":"13"},{"value":"40+","name":"优质选修课"},{"value":"50+","name":"学生社团"}],"id":"StatisticsConfig-ade994f3-f4be-4293-86b8-7cc7c2e344f5"}},{"type":"CoursesConfig","props":{"title":"课程概览","id":"CoursesConfig-efe83e44-a6b8-496e-9ca2-bf2570f4c878","resolvedCourses":{"National Curriculum":[{"id":23,"type":"course","titlePublishedEN":"Chinese Literature","titlePublishedZH":"语文","titleDraftEN":"Chinese Literature","titleDraftZH":"语文","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishedZH":null,"shortContentDraftEN":null,"shortContentDraftZH":null,"slug":"chinese-literature","categoryEN":"National Curriculum","categoryZH":"国家课程","coverImagePublished":null,"coverImageDraft":null,"creator":{"id":3406762,"name":"蔺东来 Lin","pinyin":"Lin Donglai","roles":["admin","writer","editor"],"type":"student","gender":"male","createdAt":"2025-10-09T00:27:24.124Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T12:22:16.336Z"},"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:04.088Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:20.092Z"}],"AP":[{"id":24,"type":"course","titlePublishedEN":"AP Biology","titlePublishedZH":"AP 生物","titleDraftEN":"AP Biology","titleDraftZH":"AP 生物","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishedZH":null,"shortContentDraftEN":null,"shortContentDraftZH":null,"slug":"ap-biology","categoryEN":"AP","categoryZH":"AP","coverImagePublished":null,"coverImageDraft":null,"creator":{"id":3406762,"name":"蔺东来 Lin","pinyin":"Lin Donglai","roles":["admin","writer","editor"],"type":"student","gender":"male","createdAt":"2025-10-09T00:27:24.124Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T12:22:16.336Z"},"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:27.629Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:46.782Z"}]}}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-d9407734-920d-45c8-9e2c-fca57d2f56cb","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66","topText":"核心课程","title":"以剑桥国际课程支撑个性化学术发展","text":"ISBA 以剑桥国际课程为重要支撑，构建系统、扎实、富有延展性的学术课程体系。13 个核心学术课程涵盖语文、数学、英语、科学、人文、艺术等多个领域，帮助学生在夯实基础的同时不断拓展学术视野。多元而均衡的课程设置，支持学生在持续探索中发现兴趣、发展优势，逐步形成适合自己的学习方向。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-b8e8e10c-b164-4391-96cb-1fb1beeb0ba7","resolvedImage":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"65","topText":"双语教学","text":"ISBA 将双语学习融入日常课堂与校园生活，帮助学生在真实、多元的环境中提升语言能力与文化理解力。我们的学生与教师来自全球 7 个国家与地区，为课堂带来丰富的文化背景与交流视角。学生在中英文之间自然切换，在不同文化语境中清晰表达观点、开展合作，逐步形成开放包容的视野与从容自信的跨文化表达能力。","title":"以双语课堂培养自如的跨文化表达"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-a9bc3ab7-474b-4786-a18b-a944929b5d23","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66","topText":"领导力","title":"以实践参与锤炼卓越的领导素养","text":"我们坚信，每位学生都应在真实参与中培养责任意识、组织能力与合作精神。ISBA 为每一位学生提供丰富的实践平台，学生可以在学委会、班级、社团、选修课以及各类项目答辩团队中承担正式角色，在服务集体与带领团队的过程中积累经验、增长能力。一次次实践历练，让学生逐步学会倾听、判断与担当。","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-08d4de00-af67-4bb4-8521-e503bdec244d","resolvedImage":{"id":45,"sha1":"77f4b800de9217193844ea2f3bbe6b7e33a886b4","name":"微信导入","altText":"由微信文章导入","width":832,"height":554,"sizeKB":38,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T09:25:34.464Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","image":"45","topText":"跨学科学习","title":"以跨学科项目连接知识与真实世界","text":"ISBA 将跨学科项目学习融入初中课程体系，引导学生在真实情境中整合知识、动手实践、解决问题。学校开设九大 STEAM 特色跨学科课程，让学生在科学、人文、艺术与技术的交汇中拓展视野、激发创造力。与此同时，全球议题、人文科学、艺术设计等特色课程也不断引导学生关注现实世界，提升综合素养，建立更开阔的理解力与表达力。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-9b4339f9-31ea-4b33-83bf-a1a28b5b38be","resolvedImage":{"id":63,"sha1":"eca52c9f86f2410f111503f970426e6a0c2bd94b","name":"Bejng Culture Exploration Program","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":853,"sizeKB":85,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:56.539Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"63","topText":"立足中华 放眼世界","title":"以中华根基对话广阔的世界课堂","text":"ISBA 重视立足北京、植根中国的文化根基，也重视学生面向世界的跨文化理解。通过中华文化寻根之旅、北京文化探究项目，学生能够深入理解中华文化的深厚内涵，在真实体验与项目探究中增强文化认同。与此同时，学校积极拓展世界大课堂，组织学生赴海外学校学习交流，在跨文化互动中开阔视野，增进理解。","linkText":"了解中西合璧的活动机会","link":"/academics/pbl"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-89e7f650-fce5-45fb-b357-5085cd8aeb96","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","topText":"课外学习项目","image":"62","text":"ISBA 尊重每一位学生独特的兴趣与潜能，并通过丰富多元的课程与活动平台支持学生持续探索、自主成长。40 余门选修课、50 余个学生社团覆盖音乐、视觉艺术、表演艺术、科学、人文、运动等多个领域，为学生提供广阔的发展空间。3/28 走进自然、北中小舞台、北中小讲师等活动，让学生在自主设计、公开表达与实践体验中不断发现热爱、发展所长。","title":"以多彩平台滋养真实的兴趣与热爱","link":"/life","linkText":"了解 ISBA 的课外学习项目"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-334833eb-7126-4828-b891-157eab5bb851","resolvedImage":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74","title":"以责任担当践行 \\"世界因我更美好\\" 的理念","topText":"公民、责任与担当","image":"59","text":"在 ISBA，服务是学生承担公民义务的重要方式。我们的学生从真实问题出发，关注他人、关注社区、关注更广阔的公共议题。ISBA 学生为城中村留守儿童开展关爱行动，为视障人士设计导航软件，举办慈善音乐会，推动更多人关注全球饥饿等议题。在一次次切实的参与中，\\"世界因我更美好\\" 逐渐成为学生的价值追求与自觉行动。","link":"/projects","linkText":"了解我们的学生项目"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-3cb24aa8-7b15-4ca9-ba51-52b701a00121","resolvedImage":{"id":6,"sha1":"9942a41c5b79b01ed07566182c6e54e34b3079b7","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":6016,"height":3384,"sizeKB":1204,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:02:23.332Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","topText":"高中项目","image":"6","link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"了解我们的高中项目","title":"为高中生活打好坚实的基础","text":"ISBA 以中国国家课程与剑桥国际初中课程为基础，注重严谨的学术训练，帮助学生扎实掌握各学科核心知识，形成良好的学习习惯与清晰的学习方法，为进入高中阶段高标准、高要求的美国大学先修 (AP) 课程做好充分准备。"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-5746387e-05e4-4ffe-817e-98a99b707e7c"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"了解 ISBA 的初中招生项目","link":"/admissions/isba","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-f611e007-29ee-4896-9954-7d6d48f7687d"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-aa1849aa-ee82-48a8-9d15-b220f39c03f0"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"Middle School Program"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-3a2fc548-1d42-4a66-b4b4-6e2b9577d15d"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Curious minds. Strong foundations. Ready for what's next.","text":"The middle school program builds knowledge, honors individuality, and encourages exploration, helping students grow into capable, thoughtful, and responsible young minds.","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-05723633-03a2-48f8-90c8-feb3d64952c1"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-81d123d9-11f7-4594-a861-4c25827790bd"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Middle School","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"topPadding":false,"id":"HeroConfig-3e23efda-546f-40a8-98dd-7b0f4df2967c","resolvedImage":{"id":64,"sha1":"15f6901d80775583c340abba2d020f0ce28fbeb6","name":"Life at BAID","altText":"People playing football on the playground","width":3976,"height":2652,"sizeKB":431,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:05:12.808Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"64"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-f8d9446c-b9a1-40c8-b09b-b05f7ff0e13b"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Unlock your potential","text":"The International School of Beijing Academy (ISBA) middle school program brings together China's national curriculum and the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum to create a learning experience that is both structured and forward-looking. With a strong focus on academic foundations, thinking skills, and language development, our program helps students build sound study habits, a solid base of knowledge, and an open global perspective. Through these years of growth and preparation, students are ready to step confidently into the rigor and challenge of AP courses in high school.","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-66ff8c03-4b29-403f-a022-c535c47e680b"}},{"type":"StatisticsConfig","props":{"title":"ISBA in Numbers","content":[{"name":"teacher-student ratio","value":"1:7"},{"name":"core STEAM courses","value":"9"},{"name":"average homeroom size","value":"~20"},{"name":"Cambridge academic courses","value":"13"},{"value":"40+","name":"outstanding electives"},{"value":"50+","name":"student clubs"}],"id":"StatisticsConfig-ade994f3-f4be-4293-86b8-7cc7c2e344f5"}},{"type":"CoursesConfig","props":{"title":"Courses Overview","id":"CoursesConfig-efe83e44-a6b8-496e-9ca2-bf2570f4c878","resolvedCourses":{"National Curriculum":[{"id":23,"type":"course","titlePublishedEN":"Chinese Literature","titlePublishedZH":"语文","titleDraftEN":"Chinese Literature","titleDraftZH":"语文","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishedZH":null,"shortContentDraftEN":null,"shortContentDraftZH":null,"slug":"chinese-literature","categoryEN":"National Curriculum","categoryZH":"国家课程","coverImagePublished":null,"coverImageDraft":null,"creator":{"id":3406762,"name":"蔺东来 Lin","pinyin":"Lin Donglai","roles":["admin","writer","editor"],"type":"student","gender":"male","createdAt":"2025-10-09T00:27:24.124Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T12:22:16.336Z"},"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:04.088Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:20.092Z"}],"AP":[{"id":24,"type":"course","titlePublishedEN":"AP Biology","titlePublishedZH":"AP 生物","titleDraftEN":"AP Biology","titleDraftZH":"AP 生物","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishedZH":null,"shortContentDraftEN":null,"shortContentDraftZH":null,"slug":"ap-biology","categoryEN":"AP","categoryZH":"AP","coverImagePublished":null,"coverImageDraft":null,"creator":{"id":3406762,"name":"蔺东来 Lin","pinyin":"Lin Donglai","roles":["admin","writer","editor"],"type":"student","gender":"male","createdAt":"2025-10-09T00:27:24.124Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T12:22:16.336Z"},"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:27.629Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:46.782Z"}]}}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-d9407734-920d-45c8-9e2c-fca57d2f56cb","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66","topText":"Core Curriculum","title":"Personalized Academic Growth, Supported by Cambridge","text":"At ISBA, the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum plays a central role in our academic program that is rigorous, well-rounded, and full of possibility. Thirteen core courses span Chinese, mathematics, English, science, humanities, and the arts, giving students a strong foundation while opening the door to wider exploration."}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-b8e8e10c-b164-4391-96cb-1fb1beeb0ba7","resolvedImage":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"65","topText":"Bilingual Classroom","text":"At ISBA, bilingual learning is part of everyday classroom and campus life. Our students and teachers come from 7 countries and regions, bringing diverse perspectives into every class. Moving naturally between Chinese and English, students learn to express ideas clearly, work across cultures, and develop the confidence and openness to thrive in a global setting.\\n","title":"Bilingual Learning, Global Fluency"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-a9bc3ab7-474b-4786-a18b-a944929b5d23","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66","topText":"Leadership","title":"Leadership, Built Through Action","text":"We believe leadership grows through real responsibility. Every student has opportunities to step forward, contribute, and lead. Whether in the Student Council, the classroom, clubs, electives, or projects, students take on meaningful roles and learn by doing. Through each experience, they build judgment, collaboration, and grow into people ready to listen, decide, and take responsibility.","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-08d4de00-af67-4bb4-8521-e503bdec244d","resolvedImage":{"id":45,"sha1":"77f4b800de9217193844ea2f3bbe6b7e33a886b4","name":"微信导入","altText":"由微信文章导入","width":832,"height":554,"sizeKB":38,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T09:25:34.464Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","image":"45","topText":"Interdisciplinary Learning","title":"The World in My Heart","text":"At ISBA, interdisciplinary learning brings knowledge to life. Students are encouraged to connect ideas across subjects, work through real challenges, and learn by doing. Nine signature STEAM courses invite them to explore where science, humanities, art, and technology meet. At the same time, courses centered on global issues, the humanities, and design support students in their engagement with the world around them.\\n"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-9b4339f9-31ea-4b33-83bf-a1a28b5b38be","resolvedImage":{"id":63,"sha1":"eca52c9f86f2410f111503f970426e6a0c2bd94b","name":"Bejng Culture Exploration Program","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":853,"sizeKB":85,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:56.539Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"63","topText":"From China to the World","title":"Chinese Foundations, Global Dialogue","text":"At ISBA, we are first and foremost a Chinese school. Through programs such as the Beijing Cultural Exploration Program and the Chinese Cultural Roots Journey, students strengthen their cultural identity as Chinese peoples. At the same time, ISBA continues to expand the classroom beyond borders, with opportunities for students to study and connect with schools overseas, broaden their perspective, and engage the world with greater understanding.","linkText":"Discover global opportunities at ISBA","link":"/academics/pbl"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-89e7f650-fce5-45fb-b357-5085cd8aeb96","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","topText":"Beyond the Classroom","image":"62","text":"Through a rich mix of courses, activities, and platforms, students are encouraged to explore widely and grow with purpose. More than 40 electives and over 50 student-led clubs span music, visual arts, performing arts, science, the humanities, and athletics. Programs and activities such as Into Nature, BAID Stage, and BAID Speaker give students infinite possibilities to design, express, and discover.","title":"More to Try, More to Love","link":"/life","linkText":"Learn about life beyond the classroom at ISBA"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-334833eb-7126-4828-b891-157eab5bb851","resolvedImage":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74","title":"Better Me, Better World","topText":"Global Citizenship","image":"59","text":"At ISBA, service is a meaningful way students live out their role as active global citizens. Our students support left-behind children in urban villages, design navigation software for people with visual impairments, organize charity concerts, and bring greater attention to issues such as global hunger. Through real actions, our belief of \\"Better Me, Better World\\" becomes our way of living.","link":"/projects","linkText":"Visit our student projects gallery"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-3cb24aa8-7b15-4ca9-ba51-52b701a00121","resolvedImage":{"id":6,"sha1":"9942a41c5b79b01ed07566182c6e54e34b3079b7","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":6016,"height":3384,"sizeKB":1204,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:02:23.332Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","topText":"High School Program","image":"6","link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"Discover our high school program","title":"A Strong Foundation for High School and Beyond","text":"Built on China's national curriculum and the Cambridge Lower Secondary curriculum, the ISBA middle school program places strong emphasis on academic rigor and thoughtful preparation. Students develop a solid grasp of core subjects, build strong study habits, and learn clear, effective ways to approach their work. By the time they move into high school, they will have been already well prepared for our rigorous AP curriculum."}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-5746387e-05e4-4ffe-817e-98a99b707e7c"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"Learn more about ISBA's middle school admissions","link":"/admissions/isba","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-f611e007-29ee-4896-9954-7d6d48f7687d"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-aa1849aa-ee82-48a8-9d15-b220f39c03f0"}}],"zones":{}}	{"root":{"props":{"title":"初中项目"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-3a2fc548-1d42-4a66-b4b4-6e2b9577d15d"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"乐学善思、全面发展的未来少年","text":"初中课程体系注重基础、尊重个性、鼓励探究，帮助学生在真实而丰富的学习体验中不断提升自我，成长为有理想、有能力、有担当的少年。","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-05723633-03a2-48f8-90c8-feb3d64952c1"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-81d123d9-11f7-4594-a861-4c25827790bd"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Middle School","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"topPadding":false,"id":"HeroConfig-3e23efda-546f-40a8-98dd-7b0f4df2967c","resolvedImage":{"id":64,"sha1":"15f6901d80775583c340abba2d020f0ce28fbeb6","name":"Life at BAID","altText":"People playing football on the playground","width":3976,"height":2652,"sizeKB":431,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:05:12.808Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"64"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-f8d9446c-b9a1-40c8-b09b-b05f7ff0e13b"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"发展少年的无限潜能","text":"北中外籍人员子女学校 (International School of Beijing Academy, ISBA) 初中项目，融合中国国家课程与剑桥国际初中课程，为学生提供兼具系统性与发展性的学习体验。课程注重学科基础、思维训练与语言能力的全面提升，帮助学生在初中阶段逐步建立良好的学习习惯、扎实的知识结构与开放的国际视野。通过这一阶段的充分积累，学生将为进入高中阶段高标准、高要求的美国大学先修课程 (AP) 做好准备，在未来的学术挑战中更加自信从容。","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-66ff8c03-4b29-403f-a022-c535c47e680b"}},{"type":"StatisticsConfig","props":{"title":"从数字看 ISBA","content":[{"name":"师生比","value":"1:7"},{"name":"特色 STEAM 课程","value":"9"},{"name":"班额","value":"~20"},{"name":"可选核心学术课程","value":"13"},{"value":"40+","name":"优质选修课"},{"value":"50+","name":"学生社团"}],"id":"StatisticsConfig-ade994f3-f4be-4293-86b8-7cc7c2e344f5"}},{"type":"CoursesConfig","props":{"title":"课程概览","id":"CoursesConfig-efe83e44-a6b8-496e-9ca2-bf2570f4c878","resolvedCourses":{"National Curriculum":[{"id":23,"type":"course","titlePublishedEN":"Chinese Literature","titlePublishedZH":"语文","titleDraftEN":"Chinese Literature","titleDraftZH":"语文","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishedZH":null,"shortContentDraftEN":null,"shortContentDraftZH":null,"slug":"chinese-literature","categoryEN":"National Curriculum","categoryZH":"国家课程","coverImagePublished":null,"coverImageDraft":null,"creator":{"id":3406762,"name":"蔺东来 Lin","pinyin":"Lin Donglai","roles":["admin","writer","editor"],"type":"student","gender":"male","createdAt":"2025-10-09T00:27:24.124Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T12:22:16.336Z"},"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:04.088Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:20.092Z"}],"AP":[{"id":24,"type":"course","titlePublishedEN":"AP Biology","titlePublishedZH":"AP 生物","titleDraftEN":"AP Biology","titleDraftZH":"AP 生物","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishedZH":null,"shortContentDraftEN":null,"shortContentDraftZH":null,"slug":"ap-biology","categoryEN":"AP","categoryZH":"AP","coverImagePublished":null,"coverImageDraft":null,"creator":{"id":3406762,"name":"蔺东来 Lin","pinyin":"Lin Donglai","roles":["admin","writer","editor"],"type":"student","gender":"male","createdAt":"2025-10-09T00:27:24.124Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T12:22:16.336Z"},"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:27.629Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-22T13:02:46.782Z"}]}}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-d9407734-920d-45c8-9e2c-fca57d2f56cb","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66","topText":"核心课程","title":"以剑桥国际课程支撑个性化学术发展","text":"ISBA 以剑桥国际课程为重要支撑，构建系统、扎实、富有延展性的学术课程体系。13 个核心学术课程涵盖语文、数学、英语、科学、人文、艺术等多个领域，帮助学生在夯实基础的同时不断拓展学术视野。多元而均衡的课程设置，支持学生在持续探索中发现兴趣、发展优势，逐步形成适合自己的学习方向。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-b8e8e10c-b164-4391-96cb-1fb1beeb0ba7","resolvedImage":{"id":65,"sha1":"29587e370b2cc9463b8858e7c81b0f51418f5759","name":"Student Projects","altText":"BAID students' ocean protection project","width":1920,"height":1039,"sizeKB":102,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:31:36.244Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","image":"65","topText":"双语教学","text":"ISBA 将双语学习融入日常课堂与校园生活，帮助学生在真实、多元的环境中提升语言能力与文化理解力。我们的学生与教师来自全球 7 个国家与地区，为课堂带来丰富的文化背景与交流视角。学生在中英文之间自然切换，在不同文化语境中清晰表达观点、开展合作，逐步形成开放包容的视野与从容自信的跨文化表达能力。","title":"以双语课堂培养自如的跨文化表达"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-a9bc3ab7-474b-4786-a18b-a944929b5d23","resolvedImage":{"id":66,"sha1":"7a822d9377fc189c33d4b60980ca3cf841c646b8","name":"Admssons","altText":"ppl plang basketball","width":4000,"height":2667,"sizeKB":321,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T13:52:58.599Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"66","topText":"领导力","title":"以实践参与锤炼卓越的领导素养","text":"我们坚信，每位学生都应在真实参与中培养责任意识、组织能力与合作精神。ISBA 为每一位学生提供丰富的实践平台，学生可以在学委会、班级、社团、选修课以及各类项目答辩团队中承担正式角色，在服务集体与带领团队的过程中积累经验、增长能力。一次次实践历练，让学生逐步学会倾听、判断与担当。","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-08d4de00-af67-4bb4-8521-e503bdec244d","resolvedImage":{"id":45,"sha1":"77f4b800de9217193844ea2f3bbe6b7e33a886b4","name":"微信导入","altText":"由微信文章导入","width":832,"height":554,"sizeKB":38,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T09:25:34.464Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","image":"45","topText":"跨学科学习","title":"以跨学科项目连接知识与真实世界","text":"ISBA 将跨学科项目学习融入初中课程体系，引导学生在真实情境中整合知识、动手实践、解决问题。学校开设九大 STEAM 特色跨学科课程，让学生在科学、人文、艺术与技术的交汇中拓展视野、激发创造力。与此同时，全球议题、人文科学、艺术设计等特色课程也不断引导学生关注现实世界，提升综合素养，建立更开阔的理解力与表达力。"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":false,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-9b4339f9-31ea-4b33-83bf-a1a28b5b38be","resolvedImage":{"id":63,"sha1":"eca52c9f86f2410f111503f970426e6a0c2bd94b","name":"Bejng Culture Exploration Program","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":853,"sizeKB":85,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:56.539Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"63","topText":"立足中华 放眼世界","title":"以中华根基对话广阔的世界课堂","text":"ISBA 重视立足北京、植根中国的文化根基，也重视学生面向世界的跨文化理解。通过中华文化寻根之旅、北京文化探究项目，学生能够深入理解中华文化的深厚内涵，在真实体验与项目探究中增强文化认同。与此同时，学校积极拓展世界大课堂，组织学生赴海外学校学习交流，在跨文化互动中开阔视野，增进理解。","linkText":"了解中西合璧的活动机会","link":"/academics/pbl"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-89e7f650-fce5-45fb-b357-5085cd8aeb96","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#9f0612","topText":"课外学习项目","image":"62","text":"ISBA 尊重每一位学生独特的兴趣与潜能，并通过丰富多元的课程与活动平台支持学生持续探索、自主成长。40 余门选修课、50 余个学生社团覆盖音乐、视觉艺术、表演艺术、科学、人文、运动等多个领域，为学生提供广阔的发展空间。3/28 走进自然、北中小舞台、北中小讲师等活动，让学生在自主设计、公开表达与实践体验中不断发现热爱、发展所长。","title":"以多彩平台滋养真实的兴趣与热爱","link":"/life","linkText":"了解 ISBA 的课外学习项目"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":false,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-334833eb-7126-4828-b891-157eab5bb851","resolvedImage":{"id":59,"sha1":"dfdbae4816a16dd1a41563aac9cf52ecfdf204ee","name":"BA Lectures","altText":"olympics gold medalist Yang Yang at an event","width":1080,"height":720,"sizeKB":68,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:49:50.419Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#4f5b74","title":"以责任担当践行 \\"世界因我更美好\\" 的理念","topText":"公民、责任与担当","image":"59","text":"在 ISBA，服务是学生承担公民义务的重要方式。我们的学生从真实问题出发，关注他人、关注社区、关注更广阔的公共议题。ISBA 学生为城中村留守儿童开展关爱行动，为视障人士设计导航软件，举办慈善音乐会，推动更多人关注全球饥饿等议题。在一次次切实的参与中，\\"世界因我更美好\\" 逐渐成为学生的价值追求与自觉行动。","link":"/projects","linkText":"了解我们的学生项目"}},{"type":"ImageTextLayoutConfig","props":{"lightText":true,"inverseOrder":true,"id":"ImageTextLayoutConfig-3cb24aa8-7b15-4ca9-ba51-52b701a00121","resolvedImage":{"id":6,"sha1":"9942a41c5b79b01ed07566182c6e54e34b3079b7","name":"Test","altText":"Test","width":6016,"height":3384,"sizeKB":1204,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-10-14T03:02:23.332Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","backgroundColor":"#103c74","topText":"高中项目","image":"6","link":"/academics/high-school","linkText":"了解我们的高中项目","title":"为高中生活打好坚实的基础","text":"ISBA 以中国国家课程与剑桥国际初中课程为基础，注重严谨的学术训练，帮助学生扎实掌握各学科核心知识，形成良好的学习习惯与清晰的学习方法，为进入高中阶段高标准、高要求的美国大学先修 (AP) 课程做好充分准备。"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-5746387e-05e4-4ffe-817e-98a99b707e7c"}},{"type":"ButtonConfig","props":{"text":"了解 ISBA 的初中招生项目","link":"/admissions/isba","blank":false,"color":"blue","size":"md","align":"center","id":"ButtonConfig-f611e007-29ee-4896-9954-7d6d48f7687d"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-aa1849aa-ee82-48a8-9d15-b220f39c03f0"}}],"zones":{}}	\N	\N	3406762	2026-03-20 03:12:05.113	2026-04-05 03:55:22.203	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
40	page	Activities	校园活动	Activities	校园活动	life/activities	{"root":{"props":{"title":"Activities"},"type":"root"},"content":[{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-dfbfc70a-e21d-4c48-88ab-fcee79cfc30e"}},{"type":"HorizontalTopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Step out and come together here","text":"At BAID, we learn and create together, heading out into Beijing and further afield. With each experience, we come to understand the world a little more—and ourselves as well.","id":"HorizontalTopTextConfig-eb9fa322-3afb-450e-806d-fc9c3ae26f65"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-df619cd5-80cf-4257-a507-2895112a1bdd"}},{"type":"HeroConfig","props":{"title":"Activities","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","lightText":false,"topPadding":false,"id":"HeroConfig-12d1ef46-0413-4943-878a-3e9d989ba73a","resolvedImage":{"id":62,"sha1":"073e82273837daeeaeec0f2e8a4603b962cbb875","name":"BA World School","altText":"Test","width":1280,"height":960,"sizeKB":316,"uploaderId":3406762,"createdAt":"2025-12-22T12:50:43.209Z"},"resolvedUploadPrefix":"/uploads","image":"62"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"64px","id":"SpacerConfig-67af3430-4ad1-4320-91c9-aa3820863ddd"}},{"type":"TopTextConfig","props":{"title":"Make these years count","text":"Activities fill campus life, while learning extends beyond it—across the city and across borders. We explore, engage, and set out together, building shared experiences along the way.","to":"","linkText":"","id":"TopTextConfig-de9a597c-69cb-4d24-b52b-02dfb6c8219f"}},{"type":"SpacerConfig","props":{"height":"5rem","id":"SpacerConfig-ba4e03e9-cc36-45e2-b22a-3003460e6ae5"}},{"type":"ActivitiesConfig","props":{"title":"School Activities","id":"ActivitiesConfig-09f8b2bd-e4f9-45d3-bdc2-e1c38732cffb","resolvedActivities":[{"activity":{"id":19,"type":"activity","titlePublishedEN":"taset","titlePublishedZH":"Tat","titleDraftEN":"taset","titleDraftZH":"Tat","shortContentPublishedEN":null,"shortContentPublishe